he Met invited the break dancers to perform with the museum’s collection of breastplates, gauntlets, hoods and other heraldry live in its galleries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/10/31/nyregion/subway-dancers-metropolitan-museum-art.html', 'snippet': 'Watch: The Met invited the break dancers to perform with the museum’s collection of breastplates, gauntlets, hoods and other heraldry live in its galleries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Out of nowhere, the clang of armor and the beat of hip-hop music boomed through a gallery at the Metropolitan Museum of Art. Tourists who had been peering at filigreed shields and wrought-iron broadswords swung toward the sound.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Subway Break Dancers, Clad in Armor, Go Medieval at the Met Museum', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Breakdancers Bringing the Met to Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARMOR', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Break Dancing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Museum of Art', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-onlyinnewyork', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-01T02:03:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0ea3f292-b49f-5584-9173-203f5cfc5fca', 'word_count': 994, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0ea3f292-b49f-5584-9173-203f5cfc5fca'}, {'abstract': 'The president told a rapt crowd that “illegal immigrants are not subject to the jurisdiction of the United States.” (Legal experts would widely disagree.)', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/10/31/us/politics/trump-florida-rally-constitution.html', 'snippet': 'The president told a rapt crowd that “illegal immigrants are not subject to the jurisdiction of the United States.” (Legal experts would widely disagree.)', 'lead_paragraph': 'ESTERO, Fla. — With a somber trip to Pittsburgh to visit victims of a synagogue shooting behind him, President Trump flew to one of his favorite places in the world — Florida — on Wednesday to host another one of his high-decibel political rallies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/01TRUMPRALLY/merlin_146154495_5145c6c2-b84d-44b4-aeff-01dbb8dedd26-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/01TRUMPRALLY/merlin_146154495_5145c6c2-b84d-44b4-aeff-01dbb8dedd26-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/01TRUMPRALLY/merlin_146154495_5145c6c2-b84d-44b4-aeff-01dbb8dedd26-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/01TRUMPRALLY/merlin_146154495_5145c6c2-b84d-44b4-aeff-01dbb8dedd26-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo