ure pink Camaro won a sprint race (a race based on lap time that lasted about 10 to 15 minutes) at this year’s Maker Faire. She built the car with a software engineer in four months, and on the first day of last year’s Maker Faire, they burned out the entire electrical system by dropping a laptop into the Camaro while the car was open. They sometimes use the car for endurance races, which are 75 minutes long. “Anything that can go wrong, will go wrong, during the endurance race,” said Ms. Herchenroeder, who has to use her entire weight (about the same as the car’s) to steer the vehicle.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/04/learning/04makerside5/04makerside5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 840, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/04/learning/04makerside5/04makerside5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 840}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/04/learning/04makerside5/04makerside5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 732, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/04/learning/04makerside5/04makerside5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1463, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/04/learning/04makerside5/04makerside5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/04/learning/04makerside5/04makerside5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'i