ail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/business/dealbookemail/02db-newsletter-sundar/merlin_145848801_44965a06-39b6-45a7-b5fd-0244f1bbff9f-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/02/business/dealbookemail/02db-newsletter-sundar/merlin_145848801_44965a06-39b6-45a7-b5fd-0244f1bbff9f-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/business/dealbookemail/02db-newsletter-sundar/merlin_145848801_44965a06-39b6-45a7-b5fd-0244f1bbff9f-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'DealBook Briefing: Tune Into Today’s Live Coverage of Our Annual Conference', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barra, Mary T', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blankfein, Lloyd C', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fink, Laurence D', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pichai, Sundar', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thiel, Peter A', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-01T10:18:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb87e4f8-9dc5-5d7a-b45f-0a421b70a3d5', 'word_count': 1767, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb87e4f8-9dc5-5d7a-b45f-0a421b70a3d5'}, {'abstract': 'The film proves that Clark still loves skaters, sex, and sad youth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/01/movies/marfa-girl-2-review.html', 'snippet': 'The film proves that Clark still loves skaters, sex, and sad youth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been some years since Larry Clark’s days as one of American cinema’s foremost provocateurs, a pioneering photographer who took his fascination with dead-end lives, drug use, and adolescent sexuality and channeled it into controversial, acclaimed films such as “Kids” (1995) and “Bully” (2001). And although it’s loaded with sex, the most brazen thing about “Marfa Girl 2” might be that it presupposes some knowledge of “Marfa Girl,” which played the Rome Film Festival in 2012, received limited theatrical distribution in 2015 and made little impact with critics or audiences. Even stranger: Clark actually includes scenes from the earlier film in this one, though they only add minimal context.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/30/arts/marfa1/marfa1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/10/30/arts/marfa1/marfa1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/30/arts/marfa1/marfa1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/30/arts/marfa1/marfa1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/30/arts/marfa1/marfa1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/10/30/arts/marfa1/marfa1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/30/arts/marfa1/marfa1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Marfa Girl 2,’ Larry Clark’s Sequel to One of His Least-Known Films', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Marfa Girl 2', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clark, Larry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Marfa Girl 2 (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-01T11:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bilge Ebiri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bilge', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ebiri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/0436383e-08e0-5633-bf7b-7431bac7b0fe', 'word_count': 262, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0436383e-08e0-5633-bf7b-7431bac7b0fe'}, {'abstract': 'This gabby, gossipy documentary about the rise of the Dallas Cowboys cheerleaders teeters entertainingly between liberation and exploitation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/01/movies/daughters-of-the-sexual-revolution-the-untold-story-of-the-dallas-cowboys-cheerleaders-review.html', 'snippet': 'This gabby, gossipy documentary about the rise of the Dallas Cowboys cheerleaders teeters entertainingly between liberation and exploitation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Would that the title of “Daughters of the Sexual Revolution: The Untold Story of the Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders” had been edited as punchily as the movie it announces. Perky and informative, this gabby, gossipy documentary from Dana Adam Shapiro follows the founding and stratospheric rise of the original spangled squad and the controversies it kicked up with those famous white boots.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/31/arts/daughters1/daughters1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/10/31/arts/daughters1/daughters1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/31/arts/daughters1/daughters1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/31/arts/daughters1/daughters1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1151, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/31/arts/daughters1/daughters1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/10/31/arts/daughters1/daughters1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/31/arts/daughters1/daughters1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘Daughters of the Sexual Revolution,’ Pompoms and Patriotism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Daughters of the Sexual Revolution', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheerleaders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Cowboys', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shapiro, Dana Adam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mitchell, Suzanne', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Daughters of the Sexual Revolution: The Untold Story of the Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-01T11:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeannette Catsoulis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeannette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Catsoulis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/242e2de5-a752-5ccb-8ca5-79a3f365320e', 'word_count': 316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/242e2de5-a752-5ccb-8ca5-79a3f365320e'}, {'abstract': 'Kailash Satyarthi, who shared the Nobel Peace Prize in 2014, does inspiring work. But this subject makes for a routine awareness documentary.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/01/movies/the-price-of-free-review-documentary.html', 'snippet': 'Kailash Satyarthi, who shared the Nobel Peace Prize in 2014, does inspiring work. But this subject makes for a routine awareness documentary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even an extraordinary person doesn’t necessarily make for a dynamic movie subject. That appears to the case with Kailash Satyarthi, an activist in India who was one of two Nobel Peace Prize winners in 2014 and has devoted his career to rescuing children working as factory slaves. He