 'nyt://article/9840d798-9d17-5b69-857a-ee8527a49f68'}, {'abstract': 'Shevaun Mizrahi’s unadorned documentary about Turkish history and identity is too diffuse and withholding to add up to a cogent result.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/01/movies/distant-constellation-review-documentary.html', 'snippet': 'Shevaun Mizrahi’s unadorned documentary about Turkish history and identity is too diffuse and withholding to add up to a cogent result.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It would take a telescope to observe anything exciting in “Distant Constellation,” Shevaun Mizrahi’s aptly named exercise in extreme-minimalist documentary. Said to be intended as a reflection on shifts in Turkish history and identity, it is too diffuse and withholding to add up to a cogent result.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/arts/02distantconstellation/merlin_145888266_48f2a127-db3d-4cbd-8d52-383e430f91a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/02/arts/02distantconstellation/merlin_145888266_48f2a127-db3d-4cbd-8d52-383e430f91a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/arts/02distantconstellation/merlin_145888266_48f2a127-db3d-4cbd-8d52-383e430f91a4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/arts/02distantconstellation/merlin_145888266_48f2a127-db3d-4cbd-8d52-383e430f91a4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cred