e, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/world/02brazil-print/02brazil1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bolsonaro’s Cabinet Will Include Brazil Judge Who Convicted Lula', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge Who Convicted Former President Takes Position in Bolsonaro’s Cabinet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Workers' Party (Brazil)", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Da Silva, Luiz Inacio Lula', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bolsonaro, Jair (1955- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moro, Sergio (1972- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brazil', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-01T20:00:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ernesto Londoño', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ernesto', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Londoño', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b4a23a6-26da-5a27-9f48-5169d528b2a2', 'word_count': 857, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b4a23a6-26da-5a27-9f48-5169d528b2a2'}, {'abstract': 'New smartphone season is here, but last year’s models can offer similarly impressive features at great discounts. These tips will help you grab one without regretting it later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/01/smarter-living/buying-used-phone-tips.html', 'snippet': 'New smartphone season is here, but last year’s models can offer similarly impressive features at great discounts. These tips will help you grab one without regretting it later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Apple, Samsung and Google have all launched their new phones. Everyone in the world is itching to upgrade to the latest and greatest, but not you. You’re a deal hunter, and while everyone else is paying $1,000 or more for a shiny new device, you’re buying a used version of last year’s almost-as-good model for a fraction of the cost. Here’s how to get a deal without getting scammed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/business/02sl-usedphone1/02sl-usedphone1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/02/business/02sl-usedphone1/02sl-usedphone1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 359}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/business/02sl-usedphone1/02sl-usedphone1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 612, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/business/02sl-usedphone1/02sl-usedphone1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1224, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/business/02sl-usedphone1/02sl-usedphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/02/business/02sl-usedphone1/02sl-usedphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/02/business/02sl-usedphone1/02sl-usedphone1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop