or-tat penalties, initiated by the continued detention of an American pastor in Turkey, were imposed in August. They were simultaneously scrubbed in a sign of warming relations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/02/world/europe/us-turkey-sanctions-pastor.html', 'snippet': 'The tit-for-tat penalties, initiated by the continued detention of an American pastor in Turkey, were imposed in August. They were simultaneously scrubbed in a sign of warming relations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The United States and Turkey have lifted sanctions against top officials in each other’s government in a mutual sign on Friday of warming diplomatic relations between the two NATO allies after last month’s release of an American pastor.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/politics/03dc-turkey/merlin_142430079_36496270-c079-4d10-8d51-64d48841e1e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/03/us/politics/03dc-turkey/merlin_142430079_36496270-c079-4d10-8d51-64d48841e1e9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/politics/03dc-turkey/merlin_142430079_36496270-c079-4d10-8d51-64d48841e1e9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/politics/03dc-turkey/merlin_142430079_36496270-c079-4d10-8d51-64d48841e1e9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1395, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/politics/03dc-turkey/03dc-turkey-thu