/1b0b6555-22ae-51b0-b3be-933543b61c53', 'word_count': 1226, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1b0b6555-22ae-51b0-b3be-933543b61c53'}, {'abstract': 'Editors in our graphics department discuss how they turn vast troves of voting data into dynamic maps that help readers understand and explore election results.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/04/reader-center/how-we-cover-elections-interactive-maps.html', 'snippet': 'Editors in our graphics department discuss how they turn vast troves of voting data into dynamic maps that help readers understand and explore election results.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an effort to shed more light on how we work, The Times is running a series of short posts explaining some of our journalistic practices. Read more of this series here.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/06/reader-center/05utt-maps/05utt-maps-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/06/reader-center/05utt-maps/05utt-maps-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/06/reader-center/05utt-maps/05utt-maps-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/06/reader-center/05utt-maps/05utt-maps-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/06/reader-center/05utt-maps/05utt-maps-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 