e. Their dynamic feels settled, maybe for the first time. It’s a novel experience to watch them discuss eight-year plans and give presents they assume they’ll live long enough to use. Caitriona Balfe and Sam Heughan are well-suited to this, giving Claire and Jamie a gentle married-couple telepathy that neatly sketches the state of their relationship.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/arts/05outlander-recap/merlin_146236164_2016e42e-a4cd-4b53-abed-b2da14109039-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/05/arts/05outlander-recap/merlin_146236164_2016e42e-a4cd-4b53-abed-b2da14109039-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/arts/05outlander-recap/merlin_146236164_2016e42e-a4cd-4b53-abed-b2da14109039-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/arts/05outlander-recap/merlin_146236164_2016e42e-a4cd-4b53-abed-b2da14109039-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/arts/05outlander-recap/05outlander-recap-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/05/arts/05outlander-recap/05outlander-recap-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/arts/05outlander-recap/05out