r decades, were found shot to death in their taupe house last month, residents were stunned. It was an agonizing loss of two lives, but also of a way of life.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/00MISSING-top/00MISSING-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/03/us/00MISSING-top/00MISSING-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/00MISSING-top/00MISSING-top-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/00MISSING-top/00MISSING-top-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/00MISSING-top/00MISSING-top-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/03/us/00MISSING-top/00MISSING-top-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/03/us/00MISSING-top/00MISSING-top-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mystery in a Small Town: A Quiet Couple Shot Dead, Their Daughter Missing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Couple Dead and Girl Missing: Mystery and Fear in Rural Town', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missing Persons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Barron (Wis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Closs, Denise', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Closs, James', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Closs, Jayme', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-photojournalism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-05T10:00:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir and Tim Gruber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gruber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1ca37c3-9711-586f-b890-37e5d8fbf443', 'word_count': 1202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1ca37c3-9711-586f-b890-37e5d8fbf443'}, {'abstract': 'Nearly a year ago, Akayed Ullah was charged with detonating a bomb in the New York City subway. Evidence presented at his trial last week showed how security cameras recorded his every movement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/05/nyregion/port-authority-bomber-trial.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly a year ago, Akayed Ullah was charged with detonating a bomb in the New York City subway. Evidence presented at his trial last week showed how security cameras recorded his every movement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He looked like just another straphanger, traveling from Kensington, Brooklyn, into Manhattan. But authorities claim his intentions were to terrorize, and even kill, his fellow commuters. Now, because of widespread security surveillance, with thousands of public and private security cameras on the streets, and in subway stations and apartment buildings, it’s possible to witness the journey he took on that frightening day. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/02subwaybomber-promo/02subwaybomber-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/02subwaybomber-promo/02subwaybomber-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/02subwaybomber-promo/02subwaybomber-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/02subwaybomber-promo/02subwaybomber-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 939, 'width': 1410, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/02subwaybomber-promo/02subwaybomber-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/02subwaybomber-promo/02subwaybomber-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/01/autossell/02subwaybomber-promo/02subwaybomber-promo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Subway Bomber’s Journey to 42nd Street, Captur