b-d84f-504e-b129-a9b0827466c4'}, {'abstract': 'A plain glass vase, a few simple flowers. The photographer Abelardo Morell offers a paean to his feelings — and evokes a cavalcade of art heroes. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/05/arts/design/abelardo-morrell-edwynn-houk-flowers-for-lisa.html', 'snippet': 'A plain glass vase, a few simple flowers. The photographer Abelardo Morell offers a paean to his feelings — and evokes a cavalcade of art heroes. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Back in February 2014, the eminent American photographer Abelardo Morell found himself getting tired of the same old thing — that thing being his annual ritual of gifting Lisa A. McElaney, his wife and partner of almost 40 years, with a bouquet of flowers on the occasion of her birthday. (Truth be told, Lisa, herself a distinguished filmmaker and social worker, may not have been all that thrilled at the prospect either.) So instead he hazarded something altogether fresh: a photo of a gift of flowers.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11abelardo-main/11abelardo-main-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11abelardo-main/11abelardo-main-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 747}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11abelardo-main/11abelardo-main-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 823, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11abelardo-main/11abelardo-main-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1645, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':