nly things on the ballot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/05/opinion/midterms-trump-republicans-autocracy.html', 'snippet': 'Taxes and health care aren’t the only things on the ballot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whatever happens in the midterms, the aftermath will be ugly. But the elections are nonetheless a fork in the road. If we take one path, it will offer at least a chance for political redemption, for recovering America’s democratic values. If we take the other, we’ll be on the road to autocracy, with no obvious way to get off.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/opinion/05krugmanWeb/merlin_146288895_ada01cd7-94e0-4209-9d95-9b4acb6d368d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/05/opinion/05krugmanWeb/merlin_146288895_ada01cd7-94e0-4209-9d95-9b4acb6d368d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/opinion/05krugmanWeb/merlin_146288895_ada01cd7-94e0-4209-9d95-9b4acb6d368d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/opinion/05krugmanWeb/merlin_146288895_ada01cd7-94e0-4209-9d95-9b4acb6d368d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/05/opinion/05krugmanWeb/05krugmanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/05/opinion/05krugmanWeb/05krug