me so inflamed that a contingent of local police had to escort me to my car. I didn’t let any of it get to me. I brushed it off. In a swing district with about as many Democrats as Republicans — but all opinionated New Yorkers — dealing with voter rejection had become second nature.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '41', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/books/review/11Israel/merlin_146055939_1cea1f76-edb6-4e55-8d21-9de1fc099b13-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/11/books/review/11Israel/merlin_146055939_1cea1f76-edb6-4e55-8d21-9de1fc099b13-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 546}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/books/review/11Israel/merlin_146055939_1cea1f76-edb6-4e55-8d21-9de1fc099b13-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 933, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/books/review/11Israel/merlin_146055939_1cea1f76-edb6-4e55-8d21-9de1fc099b13-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1865, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/books/review/11Israel/11Israel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/11/books/review/11Israel/11Israel-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/books/review/11Israel/11Israel-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, '