 gender and sexuality. So why is she so little-known?", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/06/arts/design/leonor-fini-artist.html', 'snippet': "She rejected art's traditional roles for women, and spent her life blurring the lines of gender and sexuality. So why is she so little-known?", 'lead_paragraph': 'The artist Leonor Fini worked tirelessly throughout most of the 20th century, often alongside universally acknowledged masters like Max Ernst, André Breton and George Balanchine. Her paintings and designs were shown in London, Paris and New York over decades. Portraits of her, an eccentric European artiste draped in wild costume at fancy masquerade balls, regularly appeared in magazines like Life. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/arts/design/16leonor-fini-self-portrait-top/27leonor-fini-self-portrait-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 286, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/16/arts/design/16leonor-fini-self-portrait-top/27leonor-fini-self-portrait-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 286}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/arts/design/16leonor-fini-self-portrait-top/27leonor-fini-self-portrait-top-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 488, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/arts/design/16leonor-fini-self-portrait-top/27leonor-fini-self-portrait-top-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 976, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/arts/design/16leonor-fini-self-p