ke on the dish is just the thing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/07/dining/a-shakshuka-for-tonight.html', 'snippet': 'A good meal is in order today, and this greens-heavy take on the dish is just the thing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Yesterday led into a long night for newspaper peopleand all those who bird-dog the mood of the nation and the actions of its electorate. Today, pundits will try to tell us what happened and why it matters or doesn’t. Wherever you stand on the political spectrum, it may leave you more exhausted still. A good meal is in order, simple to cook, delicious to eat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/10/dining/10SKILLET3/10SKILLET3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/08/10/dining/10SKILLET3/10SKILLET3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 353}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/10/dining/10SKILLET3/10SKILLET3-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/10/dining/10SKILLET3/10SKILLET3-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1204, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/08/10/dining/10SKILLET3/10SKILLET3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/08/10/dining/10SKILLET3/10SKILLET3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ