 but highly-motivated grass-roots volunteers gathered to watch election returns. It was a night of mixed feelings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/07/us/pennsylvania-elections-volunteers-canvassing.html', 'snippet': 'At a bar outside Pittsburgh, a few dozen relatively new but highly-motivated grass-roots volunteers gathered to watch election returns. It was a night of mixed feelings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOMESTEAD, Pa. — The night began with giddy eagerness as the crowd trickled into the warren of rooms at the back of a bar just outside Pittsburgh. They were nurses, social workers, professors and retirees who had spent the last two years learning the science of campaigning from scratch and the last few months doing the grueling work.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08activistpa-print/07activistpa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08activistpa-print/07activistpa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08activistpa-print/07activistpa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08activistpa-print/07activistpa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08activistpa-print/07activistpa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08activistpa-print/07activistpa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08activistpa-print/07activistpa-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘I Don’t Even Know What to Think’: The Whiplash of Watching the Election Results', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Two Years of Campaigning, ‘I Don’t Even Know What to Think’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2018)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lamb, Conor J (1984- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-07T20:12:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Campbell Robertson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Campbell', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robertson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8996fd6-97c0-5019-b369-9433e4b9e3c4', 'word_count': 1253, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8996fd6-97c0-5019-b369-9433e4b9e3c4'}, {'abstract': 'They are poised to win more seats this year than they did in 2006, despite far fewer opportunities. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/07/upshot/2018-midterms-blue-wave-democrats.html', 'snippet': 'They are poised to win more seats this year than they did in 2006, despite far fewer opportunities. ', 'lead_paragrap