dia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/77767159-b87f-575e-b400-d53cf8d819b0', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/77767159-b87f-575e-b400-d53cf8d819b0'}, {'abstract': 'In this lesson, students reflect on why democracies are worth protecting, what elements are essential to a healthy democracy and how it is that democracies sometimes fail.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/07/learning/lesson-plans/is-democracy-at-risk-a-lesson-plan-for-us-and-global-history-classes.html', 'snippet': 'In this lesson, students reflect on why democracies are worth protecting, what elements are essential to a healthy democracy and how it is that democracies sometimes fail.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Often we take for granted that the United States is a democracy, and that democracy is a form of government worth celebrating. This lesson starts there, but then pushes students to reflect on why democracies are worth protecting, what elements are essential to a healthy democracy and how it is that democracies sometimes fail.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Is Democracy at Risk? A Lesson Plan for U.S. and Global History Classes', 'kicker': 'Civics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-11-07T21:51:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Learning', 'section_name': 'The Learning Network', 'subsection_name': 'Lesson Plans', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Gonchar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonchar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aabb433c-8ea5-5649-9aa5-b42b31d8c511', 'word_count': 2364, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aabb433c-8ea5-5649-9aa5-b42b31d8c511'}, {'abstract': 'On this week’s Modern Love podcast, the actor and talk-show host tells the story of a woman’s doubly painful breakup.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/07/style/modern-love-podcast-busy-philipps.html', 'snippet': 'On this week’s Modern Love podcast, the actor and talk-show host tells the story of a woman’s doubly painful breakup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 40, Laurie Sandell met a man with a child whom she learned to love as her own. When the relationship with the man unraveled, Ms. Sandell was forced to say goodbye not only to him but also to the little girl she had come to love. On this week’s Modern Love podcast, Busy Philipps reads Ms. Sandell’s essay, “How to Break Up With a 2-Year-Old.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/fashion/31MODERNLOVE_SPAN/31MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/fashion/31MODERNLOVE_SPAN/31MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/fashion/31MODERNLOVE_SPAN/31MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/fashion/31MODERNLOVE_SPAN/31MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1134, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/fashion/31MODERNLOVE_SPAN/31MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/31/fas