e but one will have a legislature in which a single party controls both houses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/07/us/politics/statehouse-elections.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time in 104 years, every state but one will have a legislature in which a single party controls both houses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a stark display of the nation’s divide, the lower and upper chamber of every legislature but one — Minnesota — will be controlled by the same party following Tuesday’s midterm elections. It will be the first time in 104 years that only one state will have a divided legislature.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08states/merlin_146415048_31b2d96c-0fab-4d66-9b3e-ad4d73806429-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08states/merlin_146415048_31b2d96c-0fab-4d66-9b3e-ad4d73806429-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08states/merlin_146415048_31b2d96c-0fab-4d66-9b3e-ad4d73806429-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08states/merlin_146415048_31b2d96c-0fab-4d66-9b3e-ad4d73806429-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08states/08states-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thum