'nyt://article/afecea1b-7ea3-5f6f-ae0a-1dc96f5a9fb4'}, {'abstract': 'Nearly four million ballot pages were stuffed into aging scanners on Tuesday, more than ever before, leading to widespread breakdowns and voting delays.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/07/nyregion/voting-problems-nyc-.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly four million ballot pages were stuffed into aging scanners on Tuesday, more than ever before, leading to widespread breakdowns and voting delays.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There was plenty of blame to go around for the outbreak of voting machine breakdowns and long delays that plagued New York City polling places on Election Day, but no one was certain of a precise solution — only that one was needed fast.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/08nyvoting-p1/merlin_146426691_97a41036-f99c-4383-ace2-bf4b348fde86-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/08/us/08nyvoting-p1/merlin_146426691_97a41036-f99c-4383-ace2-bf4b348fde86-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/08nyvoting-p1/merlin_146426691_97a41036-f99c-4383-ace2-bf4b348fde86-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/08nyvoting-p1/merlin_146426691_97a41036-f99c-4383-ace2-bf4b348fde86-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/08nyvoting-p1/08nyvoting-p1-thumbS