cs/fact-check-trump-news-conference.html', 'snippet': 'The day after midterm elections, the president inaccurately boasted about the results and gave misleading statements on health care, immigration and trade. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Republicans appeared to be on the verge of expanding their narrow Senate majority after Tuesday’s midterm elections. But even wins in all three races that remained uncertain on Wednesday evening would get them to only 54 seats, a number they had as recently as last year. ', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08dc-factcheck/merlin_146485155_a3e8d282-533a-435d-a2f9-f2bdd81f1e12-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08dc-factcheck/merlin_146485155_a3e8d282-533a-435d-a2f9-f2bdd81f1e12-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08dc-factcheck/merlin_146485155_a3e8d282-533a-435d-a2f9-f2bdd81f1e12-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08dc-factcheck/merlin_146485155_a3e8d282-533a-435d-a2f9-f2bdd81f1e12-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08dc-factcheck/08dc-factcheck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/08/us/politics/08dc-factcheck/08dc-factch