ts, do you have something to say about climate change, artificial intelligence, the NFL, immigration, college admissions or anything else in the news? Make an editorial cartoon that shows us what you think.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Update, Sept. 10, 2019:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/08/learning/08NETWORKINTRO-LN/trumpstudentillustrationsLN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/08/learning/08NETWORKINTRO-LN/trumpstudentillustrationsLN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/08/learning/08NETWORKINTRO-LN/trumpstudentillustrationsLN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/08/learning/08NETWORKINTRO-LN/trumpstudentillustrationsLN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/08/learning/08NETWORKINTRO-LN/trumpstudentillustrationsLN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/08/learning/08NETWORKINTRO-LN/trumpstudentillustrationsLN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/08/learning/08NETWORKINTRO-LN/trumpstudentillustrationsLN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Our Fourth Annual Student Editorial Cartoon Contest', 'kicker': 'Contests', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-11-08T10:30:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Learning', 'section_name': 'The Learning Network', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Gonchar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonchar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/04d21798-049e-525d-80b1-f2e2b0bf68da', 'word_count': 1068, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04d21798-049e-525d-80b1-f2e2b0bf68da'}, {'abstract': 'He fired Jeff Sessions. But a House Democratic majority prepares to pounce.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/08/opinion/trump-midterms-jeff-sessions-robert-mueller.html', 'snippet': 'He fired Jeff Sessions. But a House Democratic majority prepares to pounce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Frank Bruni: Ross, I hope you got more sleep than I did on Tuesday night. If not, this could be a very interesting conversation. We need to discuss the midterms and, of course, Jeff Sessions, but first, because I’m reeling, that White House news conference! President Trump really does possess mystical powers, because after years of beholding him, I remain full of wonder. I am still taken aback: the pettiness, the meanness, the extravagant flights of pure fantasy. Oh, and the epic self-congratulation. “A hot White House,” he called it. Is the A.C. broken? He said that he yearns to be boring. Well, then I yearn to be a credenza. Have you grown numb to it?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/07/opinion/07conversationWeb/merlin_146489766_af1c102e-765e-4637-b62e-d86fc026ce0c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_