//article/7134ad59-5a93-5f46-9373-89e8715e4ba3'}, {'abstract': 'This documentary from Cameron Yates looks at Flynn McGarry, a young innovator in dining who tries to live up to his hype.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/08/movies/chef-flynn-review.html', 'snippet': 'This documentary from Cameron Yates looks at Flynn McGarry, a young innovator in dining who tries to live up to his hype.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before his teenage years, Flynn McGarry contrived a fully functional kitchen in his bedroom. Nurtured by parents who were professionals in creative fields, he enlisted his school pals to “staff” his increasingly elaborate meals, made in a style heavily influenced by the elegant minimalism of restaurants like New York’s Eleven Madison Park. His Los Angeles home eventually became a supper club attended by Hollywood insiders of some particular caliber or other. (In one scene of an evening’s serving, a patron has her dish delivered as she utters the immortal phrase “P.T. Anderson and Luke Perry were there.”)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/06/arts/chefflynn1/merlin_146194824_bcd9f191-553d-490f-9580-868bbe247448-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/06/arts/chefflynn1/merlin_146194824_bcd9f191-553d-490f-9580-868bbe247448-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/06/arts/chefflynn1/merlin_146194824_bcd9f191-553d-490f-9580-868bbe247448-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/06/arts/chefflynn1/merlin_146194824_bcd9