le, his face was covered and he was dressed in black. He was armed with smoke grenades and a high-capacity magazine for his pistol, and was full of an inexplicable rage.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09gunman-01alt/09gunman-01alt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09gunman-01alt/09gunman-01alt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09gunman-01alt/09gunman-01alt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09gunman-01alt/09gunman-01alt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09gunman-01alt/09gunman-01alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09gunman-01alt/09gunman-01alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09gunman-01alt/09gunman-01alt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dueling Images: A Smiling Young Marine and a Killer Dressed in Black', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dueling Images: A Smiling Young Marine and a Killer Dressed in Black', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Thousand Oaks, Calif, Shooting (2018)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Long, Ian David (d 2018)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Borderline Bar and Grill (Thousand Oaks, Calif, Nightclub)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thousand Oaks (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-08T16:07:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Medina, Dave Philipps and Serge F. Kovaleski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Medina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Philipps', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Serge', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Kovaleski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/82928183-9eda-5bdb-a383-4b1b1e170d5e', 'word_count': 1226, 'uri': 'nyt://article/82928183-9eda-5bdb-a383-4b1b1e170d5e'}, {'abstract': 'The CNN correspondent had every right to aggressively question the president. His White House pass should be restored.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/08/opinion/jim-acosta-trump-white-house-press.html', 'snippet': 'The CNN correspondent had every right to aggressively question the president. His White House pass should be restored.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Relations between president and press have always been nettlesome, as they should be. The role of the news media in questioning and challenging power is as fundamental to democracy as the ballot. But however maddening presidents past have found reporters to be, none has wandered so far beyond accepte