he South China Sea, where the American and Chinese navies are increasingly challenging each other.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/08/world/asia/south-china-sea-risks.html', 'snippet': 'A recent near miss underscored the perils in the South China Sea, where the American and Chinese navies are increasingly challenging each other.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONOLULU — From a distance, the Chinese warship warned the American destroyer that it was on a “dangerous course” in the South China Sea. Then it raced up alongside, getting perilously close. For a few tense minutes, a collision seemed imminent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/world/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/09/world/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/world/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/world/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/world/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/09/world/09SOUTH-CH-INA-SEA-sub/09SOUTH-C