t the largest magazine publisher in America.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/business/dealbook/fortune-magazine-sold.html', 'snippet': 'Meredith acquired the title with a $2.8 billion acquisition of Time Inc. last November, in a deal that made it the largest magazine publisher in America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fortune magazine, a founding brand of the once-mighty Time Inc. empire that started publishing right after the stock market crash of 1929 and went on to chronicle the rise and fall of America’s biggest companies, has been sold to a Thai businessman for $150 million.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/business/10xp-fortune/merlin_143888952_2fa16b36-a617-4c0f-a9d4-7de4ab286c58-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/10/business/10xp-fortune/merlin_143888952_2fa16b36-a617-4c0f-a9d4-7de4ab286c58-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/business/10xp-fortune/merlin_143888952_2fa16b36-a617-4c0f-a9d4-7de4ab286c58-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/business/10xp-fortune/merlin_143888952_2fa16b36-a617-4c0f-a9d4-7de4ab286c58-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/business/10xp-fortune/10xp-fortune-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna