/arts/charlie-cox-on-the-first-time-he-owned-a-leather-jacket.html', 'snippet': 'The “Daredevil” star wears a superhero costume to work. But an encounter with Al Pacino persuaded him that a simpler garment can bring power, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was in the kitchen of my apartment staring down at a small rectangular black case that I believed contained a recorder. I believed it contained a recorder because I had been told as much, but I didn’t know for sure because I had never actually opened it. How had I let this happen? I had been tasked with one job in the summer vacation after my first year at drama school — to learn to play the instrument for the school’s tour of the Nativity play. I hadn’t. And the term was starting in T minus 12 hours. All I could do now was pray.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11FIRSTTIME-COX/11FIRSTTIME-COX-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 258, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11FIRSTTIME-COX/11FIRSTTIME-COX-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 258}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11FIRSTTIME-COX/11FIRSTTIME-COX-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11FIRSTTIME-COX/11FIRSTTIME-COX-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 881, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/arts/11FIRSTTIME-COX/11FIRSTTIME-COX-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name'