, 'headline': {'main': 'Finishing Touches', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wistful Finishing Touches to a One-Man Show', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Home Repairs and Improvements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington Heights (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'BRESNAHAN, ALYSSA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Colby, James (1961-2018)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-09T15:01:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4aaf9df-7617-5323-9197-0269bd7a597c', 'word_count': 1112, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4aaf9df-7617-5323-9197-0269bd7a597c'}, {'abstract': 'As he commemorates the 100th anniversary of the end of World War I, President Trump is determined to dismantle the international order that Woodrow Wilson sought to construct a century ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/us/politics/trump-france-world-war-1.html', 'snippet': 'As he commemorates the 100th anniversary of the end of World War I, President Trump is determined to dismantle the international order that Woodrow Wilson sought to construct a century ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Fresh off a midterm election that cost his party control of Congress, the president headed to France to take the international stage. He brought a boatful of idealism and was greeted by more than one million people thronging the streets. He planned to change the world.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/politics/10dc-prexy-print/merlin_146147388_cf63eb25-79be-49a6-81be-e81f19cc7769-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 359, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/10/us/politics/10dc-prexy-print/merlin_146147388_cf63eb25-79be-49a6-81be-e81f19cc7769-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 359}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/politics/10dc-prexy-print/merlin_146147388_cf63eb25-79be-49a6-81be-e81f19cc7769-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 613, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/politics/10dc-prexy-print/merlin_146147388_cf63eb25-79be-49a6-81be-e81f19cc7769-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1225, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/politics/10dc-prexy-print/10dc-prexy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/10/us/politics/10dc-prexy-print/10dc-prexy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/politics/10dc-prexy-print/10dc-prexy-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wilson Went to Paris to Bind America’s Ties to the World. Trump Is There to Loosen Them.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘America First’ Apostle Visits Paris 100 Years After Globalist Wilson', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2018)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sessions, Jefferson B III', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War I (1914-18)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-09T15:07:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3569e12-ecb5-534a-8c6f-5a1bdb9eeda7', 'word_count': 1468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3569e12-ecb5-534a-8c6f-5a1bdb9eeda7'}, {'abstract': 'Thousands of people have fled and hundreds of buildings have burned as wildfires raged across the state. At least nine people have been killed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/us/california-fires.html', 'snippet': 'Thousands of people have fled and hundreds of buildings have burned as wildfires raged across the state. At least nine people have been killed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THOUSAND OAKS, Calif. — Even in a state hardened to the ravages of wildfires, the infernos that raged at both ends of California on Friday were overpowering. At least nine people were killed, including several who died in their cars in a retirement community called Paradise. Malibu mansions burned. And in the neighborhood in Thousand Oaks where a gunman had killed 12 people in a crowded bar earlier in the week, survivors now fled the flames.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/10calfire-001alt/merlin_146587203_87c59fff-6f32-4834-b6f2-94fe5681d366-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/10/us/10calfire-001alt/merlin_146587203_87c59fff-6f32-4834-b6f2-94fe5681d366-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/10calfire-001alt/merlin_146587203_87c59fff-6f32-4834-b6f2-94fe5681d366-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/10calfire-001alt/merlin_146587203_87c59fff-6f32-4834-b6f2-94fe5681d366-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/10calfire-001alt/10calfire-001alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/10/us/10calfire-001alt/10calfire-001alt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/us/10calfire-001alt/10calfire-001alt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Whole World Was on Fire’: