est and deadliest in the state’s history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At least 44 people have died since three wildfires began spreading in California. The Camp Fire, which is burning in Northern California, is now the largest and deadliest in the state’s history.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/business/14warfire-01-print/00warfire-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/14/business/14warfire-01-print/00warfire-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/business/14warfire-01-print/00warfire-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/business/14warfire-01-print/00warfire-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/business/14warfire-01-print/00warfire-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/14/business/14warfire-01-print/00warfire-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/business/14warfire-01-print/00warfire-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Death Toll Climbs, Dozens Are Missing in California Wildfires', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wildfires', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evacuations and Evacuees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thousand Oaks (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chico (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-09T15:17:31+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neeti Upadhye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neeti', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Upadhye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/36de5314-0324-52a3-ba5a-3ba831719435', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/36de5314-0324-52a3-ba5a-3ba831719435'}, {'abstract': 'All four quarterbacks selected in the first 10 picks of this year’s N.F.L. draft — Mayfield, Darnold, Allen and Rosen — have struggled greatly. Do any of them have what it takes to become a star?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/sports/nfl-rookie-quarterbacks-sam-darnold.html', 'snippet': 'All four quarterbacks selected in the first 10 picks of this year’s N.F.L. draft — Mayfield, Darnold, Allen and Rosen — have struggled greatly. Do any of them have what it takes to become a star?', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is hard to pinpoint when the “Welcome to the N.F.L.” moment officially occurred for Sam Darnold. But the evidence of its arrival was clear on Wednesday as Darnold, the Jets’ rookie quarterback, trudged through the team’s locker room wearing a thick black boot on his right foot.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/sp