ht': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/10/books/review/10Obama-print/09Obama1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Her New Book, Michelle Obama Denounces Trump’s Sexism and His Promotion of the ‘Birther’ Conspiracy', 'kicker': 'Books News', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Michelle Obama Chides Trump in New Memoir', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Becoming (Book)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Michelle', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-09T17:26:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Alter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a40f86fe-2165-57b9-85f8-61fe77056aa9', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a40f86fe-2165-57b9-85f8-61fe77056aa9'}, {'abstract': 'Pilaf isn’t the sexiest dish, but it’s so comforting — as are Alison Roman’s butcher steak, a cheesy white bean tomato bake and porky rice noodles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/dining/cozy-and-clever.html', 'snippet': 'Pilaf isn’t the sexiest dish, but it’s so comforting — as are Alison Roman’s butcher steak, a cheesy white bean tomato bake and porky rice noodles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hi and welcome to Five Weeknight Dishes. I have something unsexy to discuss with you, and that is pilaf. And yet! Pilaf, versions of which are found the world over, is one of my recent favorites, adorably homely and the definition of comfort. It’s also a great way to use up chicken. My husband is our chief pilaf-maker; along with super-thin pancakes, it’s one of his specialties. (He uses a recipe from “How to Cook Everything.”) But I made it the other night, using shredded chicken, golden raisins and stock, topping each bowl with yogurt and a heap of parsley. So you could do this with leftovers, or buy a rotisserie chicken, or take control of your life and roast one just for this purpose (and for enchiladas).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/dining/05Romanrex2/merlin_143028852_04c4c45c-4f4f-4185-bb6c-b116f1967579-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/05/dining/05Romanrex2/merlin_143028852_04c4c45c-4f4f-4185-bb6c-b116f1967579-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/dining/05Romanrex2/merlin_143028852_04c4c45c-4f4f-4185-bb6c-b116f1967579-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/dining/05Romanrex2/merlin_143028852_04c4c45c-4f4f-4185-bb6c-b116f1967579-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/dining/05Romanrex2/05Romanrex2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnai