.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/us/girl-scouts-sue-boy-scouts.html', 'snippet': 'The groups had long worked together, but a rift grew after the Boy Scouts announced plans to drop the word “boy” from the program and welcome girls.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A little over a year ago, the president of the Girl Scouts of the U.S.A. sent a searing letter to her counterpart at the Boy Scouts of America, accusing his organization of engaging in a “covert campaign to recruit girls.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09xp-scouts-1/merlin_146519625_b4cb553f-956c-49c1-a41a-4ddb9999e4f8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09xp-scouts-1/merlin_146519625_b4cb553f-956c-49c1-a41a-4ddb9999e4f8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09xp-scouts-1/merlin_146519625_b4cb553f-956c-49c1-a41a-4ddb9999e4f8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09xp-scouts-1/merlin_146519625_b4cb553f-956c-49c1-a41a-4ddb9999e4f8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1386, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09xp-scouts-1/merlin_146519625_b4cb553f-956c-49c1-a41a-4ddb9999e4f8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/09/us/09xp-scouts-1/merlin_146519625_b4cb553f-956c-49c1-a41a-4ddb9999e4f8-thumbStandard.jpg