 was “a white oppressor,” he said. But he had an awakening, and became a pioneer in making a racial mix a college admissions goal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/obituaries/john-d-maguire-dead.html', 'snippet': 'As a Southern youth he was “a white oppressor,” he said. But he had an awakening, and became a pioneer in making a racial mix a college admissions goal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Long before John D. Maguire was a civil rights activist, and long before he developed some of the most inclusive college admissions standards of his day, he grew up in the segregated South with views on race that were far from enlightened.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11MAGUIRE4/merlin_146532903_8838f82f-b82f-40a5-80be-dcaad0792a14-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11MAGUIRE4/merlin_146532903_8838f82f-b82f-40a5-80be-dcaad0792a14-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 682}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11MAGUIRE4/merlin_146532903_8838f82f-b82f-40a5-80be-dcaad0792a14-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 901, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11MAGUIRE4/merlin_146532903_8838f82f-b82f-40a5-80be-dcaad0792a14-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1801, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11MAGUIRE4/09MAGUIRE4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', '