23c99c0b892'}, {'abstract': 'Lovable and wonderfully retro, jello salad gets a joyful update with natural touches from fresh clementine juice and pomegranate seeds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/dining/jello-salad-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'Lovable and wonderfully retro, jello salad gets a joyful update with natural touches from fresh clementine juice and pomegranate seeds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Little bowls of red jiggly Jell-O were a common sight in our family’s refrigerator. Cool, bouncy, sweet and light, there’s always room for it, or so the advertisements proclaimed. And its name, though trademarked, is now even listed in the dictionary, jello, a gelatin dessert.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14kitchen4/merlin_146065809_96688347-073f-4446-a8ad-aecf6710360f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14kitchen4/merlin_146065809_96688347-073f-4446-a8ad-aecf6710360f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14kitchen4/merlin_146065809_96688347-073f-4446-a8ad-aecf6710360f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14kitchen4/merlin_146065809_96688347-073f-4446-a8ad-aecf6710360f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14kitchen4/merlin_146065809_96688347-073f-4446-a8ad-aecf6710360f