bstract': 'The former first lady’s memoir is mostly about her childhood in Chicago, her marriage and her time in the White House, but she leaves room for some unequivocal criticism of President Trump.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/books/review-becoming-michelle-obama.html', 'snippet': 'The former first lady’s memoir is mostly about her childhood in Chicago, her marriage and her time in the White House, but she leaves room for some unequivocal criticism of President Trump.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For anyone who’s wondering: No, she’s not running. In her new memoir, “Becoming” — a book whose reportedly enormous advance rendered its contents almost as closely guarded as the bullion at Fort Knox — Michelle Obama puts to rest any speculation about her political ambitions. “I’ve never been a fan of politics,” she writes, “and my experience over the last 10 years has done little to change that.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/books/review/09bookobama-copy/merlin_26569051_b0cedd28-4b1a-4814-97df-09e8c24f9d5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/09/books/review/09bookobama-copy/merlin_26569051_b0cedd28-4b1a-4814-97df-09e8c24f9d5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/books/review/09bookobama-copy/merlin_26569051_b0cedd28-4b1a-4814-97df-09e8c24f9d5c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/09/books/review/09bookobama-copy/merlin_26569051_b0cedd28-4b1a-4814-97df-09e8c24f9d5c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365