//article/46c7b367-8802-5aa5-82dd-b48be770b508', 'word_count': 957, 'uri': 'nyt://article/46c7b367-8802-5aa5-82dd-b48be770b508'}, {'abstract': '“I am protesting against poverty,” Mr. Bloncourt said of his pictures of Portuguese immigrants who lived in squalor in France.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/09/obituaries/grald-bloncourt-dead.html', 'snippet': '“I am protesting against poverty,” Mr. Bloncourt said of his pictures of Portuguese immigrants who lived in squalor in France.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gérald Bloncourt, who after being expelled from Haiti for his role in antigovernment protests in 1946 went to Paris and turned his zeal for social justice into photography that captured the humanity of immigrants and factory workers, died on Oct. 29 in Paris. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/obituaries/13BLONCOURT-OBIT1/merlin_146575308_217e315c-e7fc-43e6-a77a-c9a495081824-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 659, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/13/obituaries/13BLONCOURT-OBIT1/merlin_146575308_217e315c-e7fc-43e6-a77a-c9a495081824-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 659}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/obituaries/13BLONCOURT-OBIT1/merlin_146575308_217e315c-e7fc-43e6-a77a-c9a495081824-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 933, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/obituaries/13BLONCOURT-OBIT1/merlin_146575308_217e315c-e7fc-43e6-a77a-c9a495081824-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1866, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'captio