 gain at least 1,000 rushing yards in a season, achieving the milestone twice in the 1970s, died on Saturday at an assisted living facility in Madison, N.J. He was 71.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11johnson2-print/merlin_146647056_420f3421-b32b-47a3-87c5-f7e7aca37731-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 534, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11johnson2-print/merlin_146647056_420f3421-b32b-47a3-87c5-f7e7aca37731-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 534}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11johnson2-print/merlin_146647056_420f3421-b32b-47a3-87c5-f7e7aca37731-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 911, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11johnson2-print/merlin_146647056_420f3421-b32b-47a3-87c5-f7e7aca37731-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1823, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11johnson2-print/11johnson2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11johnson2-print/11johnson2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/11/obituaries/11johnson2-print/11johnson2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'h