nyt://article/cf99f9fd-d15b-5fc4-8c54-3748206db116'}, {'abstract': 'This one-man show, about the anxieties of impending fatherhood, makes a seductive case for seeing a comedian live in the age of Netflix.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/11/theater/the-new-one-review-mike-birbiglia.html', 'snippet': 'This one-man show, about the anxieties of impending fatherhood, makes a seductive case for seeing a comedian live in the age of Netflix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If Mike Birbiglia were a piece of furniture, he would surely be a well-worn, deeply stained, slightly squishy couch, much like the one he describes at the beginning of “The New One,” his winning Broadway debut at the Cort Theater. That may not sound like a flattering comparison.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/12/arts/12newone1/merlin_146053758_d9e70b7c-46a1-4027-8e2c-2e4a5fcd611c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/12/arts/12newone1/merlin_146053758_d9e70b7c-46a1-4027-8e2c-2e4a5fcd611c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/12/arts/12newone1/merlin_146053758_d9e70b7c-46a1-4027-8e2c-2e4a5fcd611c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 734, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/12/arts/12newone1/merlin_146053758_d9e70b7c-46a1-4027-8e2c-2e4a5fcd611c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1467, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/12/arts/12newone1/12newone1-