.html', 'snippet': 'The freshman House Democrats are the most diverse, most female class in history — and span the ideological spectrum. They arrive in Washington for orientation this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — There is a former N.F.L. linebacker, a climate scientist, and a rapper with a Harvard Law degree. There is one immigrant from Somalia and another from Ecuador. There are two former C.I.A. officials, an Air Force veteran, a former Navy helicopter pilot, and a retired Marine commander — all of them women. Not to mention a pediatrician and a human rights advocate.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/us/politics/13dc-freshmen1-print/merlin_146428032_5347135a-7e01-4cc8-aa15-ddd306ac9483-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/13/us/politics/13dc-freshmen1-print/merlin_146428032_5347135a-7e01-4cc8-aa15-ddd306ac9483-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/us/politics/13dc-freshmen1-print/merlin_146428032_5347135a-7e01-4cc8-aa15-ddd306ac9483-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/us/politics/13dc-freshmen1-print/merlin_146428032_5347135a-7e01-4cc8-aa15-ddd306ac9483-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/us/politics/13dc-freshmen1-print/00dc-freshmen1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail',