/article/18a55cbb-fb12-5b5f-bc15-e5c8b7274d5a', 'word_count': 1493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18a55cbb-fb12-5b5f-bc15-e5c8b7274d5a'}, {'abstract': 'It might be a nice time for Japanese fried chicken with soy sauce-pickled eggs, a kale, coconut tomato salad, or slow-cooker chicken tacos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/12/dining/what-to-cook-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'It might be a nice time for Japanese fried chicken with soy sauce-pickled eggs, a kale, coconut tomato salad, or slow-cooker chicken tacos.', 'lead_paragraph': "Good morning. I was in Portland, Ore., over the weekend, eating great food (at Han Oak and Kachinka, if you're wondering). The visit was a chance to talk to the chef Edward Lee about his book “Buttermilk Graffiti” at the Portland Book Festival. There was no cooking for me.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/25/dining/HK-karaage-horizontal/merlin_141075300_74569dec-9fc2-4174-931d-019dddef3bb8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/07/25/dining/HK-karaage-horizontal/merlin_141075300_74569dec-9fc2-4174-931d-019dddef3bb8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/25/dining/HK-karaage-horizontal/merlin_141075300_74569dec-9fc2-4174-931d-019dddef3bb8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/07/25/dining/HK-karaage-horizontal/merlin_141075300_74569dec-9fc2-4174-931d-019dddef3bb8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cred