ourth installment of the smash animated franchise. Favorites like Woody (voiced by Tom Hanks), Buzz Lightyear (Tim Allen) and Jessie (Joan Cusack) frolic in a circle to Judy Collins’s cover of Joni Mitchell’s “Both Sides Now” until a newcomer wreaks havoc. That would be Forky.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Toy Story 4’ Trailer: Introducing Forky', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMATED FILMS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pixar Animation Studios', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Toy Story 3 (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-12T15:42:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Fretts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fretts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/511a143b-7834-5ab3-929b-407814cd445f', 'word_count': 201, 'uri': 'nyt://article/511a143b-7834-5ab3-929b-407814cd445f'}, {'abstract': 'Daly speaks about “Downstairs,” the play Theresa Rebeck wrote for him and his sister Tyne. He also discusses his life and his arts activism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/12/arts/tim-daly-downstairs-tyne-daly-madam-secretary.html', 'snippet': 'Daly speaks about “Downstairs,” the play Theresa Rebeck wrote for him and his sister Tyne. He also discusses his life and his arts activism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1979, Tim Daly was playing a Russian soldier outfitted with an imposing black wool hat in Shaw’s “Arms and the Man” in Palm Beach, Fla., when his older sister Tyne, who was performing nearby at the Burt Reynolds Dinner Theater, dropped by on closing night.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/arts/18snapshot-daly/18snapshot-daly-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/18/arts/18snapshot-daly/18snapshot-daly-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/arts/18snapshot-daly/18snapshot-daly-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/arts/18snapshot-daly/18snapshot-daly-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/arts/18snapshot-daly/18snapshot-daly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/18/arts/18snapshot-daly/18snapshot-daly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/arts/18snapshot-daly/18snapshot-daly-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tim Daly, Sibling Bonds and the Stage', 'kicker': 'A Word With', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tim Daly Says He Was His Sisters’ ‘Lab Rat’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'valu