 'uri': 'nyt://article/63d05329-eb99-50bf-bd52-10c0cf3a3940'}, {'abstract': 'Emergency workers are sifting through the ashes in a Northern California town struck by the state’s most destructive wildfire in modern history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/12/us/california-fires-camp-fire.html', 'snippet': 'Emergency workers are sifting through the ashes in a Northern California town struck by the state’s most destructive wildfire in modern history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARADISE, Calif. — [For the latest updates on the California wildfires, read our Tuesday live briefing here]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wildfire Becomes Deadliest in California History', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wildfires', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Butte County (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-12T16:41:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Nicas and Thomas Fuller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nicas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fuller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43c4c4b6-df6e-532e-bf0f-7ede836ee157', 'word_count': 2190, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43c4c4b6-df6e-532e-bf0f-7ede836ee157'}, {'abstract': 'The Scottish wildcat, the last native cat in the United Kingdom, is endangered; fewer than 100 purebred specimens remain in the wild. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nyt