e': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, Richard L', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snipes, Brenda C', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nelson, Bill (1942- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeSantis, Ron', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gillum, Andrew', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Broward County (Fla)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tuter, Jack B', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-12T20:43:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Madigan and Frances Robles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Madigan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Frances', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a57a1774-1446-5e3d-b5b6-dbc80471ca52', 'word_count': 1694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a57a1774-1446-5e3d-b5b6-dbc80471ca52'}, {'abstract': 'Goldbelly will ship pies from Union Square Hospitality Group restaurants anywhere in the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/12/dining/danny-meyer-pie-goldbelly.html', 'snippet': 'Goldbelly will ship pies from Union Square Hospitality Group restaurants anywhere in the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The question for Thanksgiving is not whether to have pie, it’s simply what kind. This year, for the first time, Goldbelly will ship nationwide fresh-baked holiday beauties from several Danny Meyer restaurants in New York. (Mr. Meyer’s Enlightened Hospitality Investments recently led a $20 million investment in Goldbelly.) Sweet potato pie ($49) from Blue Smoke, apple crostata ($65) from Caffe Marchio, apple-crumb caramel ($69) and amaro-pecan ($69) from Maialino, chocolate-bourbon-pecan ($74) from Daily Provisions, and chocolate-hazelnut cream ($79) from Gramercy Tavern may be ordered through Sunday for next-day delivery (included) by Wednesday or whatever day you specify.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14burner9/14burner9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14burner9/14burner9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14burner9/14burner9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14burner9/14burner9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14burner9/14burner9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14burner9/14burner9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/dining/14burner9/14burner9-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Send Home a Danny Meyer Pie for Thanksgiving', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Serve: Send a Danny Meyer Pie For Thanksgiving', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meyer, Danny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldbelly Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Thanksgiving Day', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Union Square Hospitality Group', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-12T20:44:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f3de26e-7935-552c-9ba5-afa17d1b4746', 'word_count': 127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f3de26e-7935-552c-9ba5-afa17d1b4746'}, {'abstract': 'A festival in Midtown Manhattan celebrates oysters from the east and west coasts of Canada.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/12/dining/canadian-oyster-festival.html', 'snippet': 'A festival in Midtown Manhattan celebrates oysters from the east and west coasts of Canada.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Canada is the source of many lip-smacking, cold-water oysters, including the flat Malpeque and one of my favorites, BeauSoleil, from New Brunswick. Docks Oyster Bar is gathering these and more than a dozen others, from the east and west coasts of Canada, to open and serve at an oyster festival on Saturday. The admission ticket includes unlimited oysters, chowders, other seafood, Canadian wines and beers, music and an oyster-shucking contest.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,