are reminiscent of war zones — not just in how they look, but in how they make the people battling the blazes feel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MALIBU — A line of burned-out cars on the side of a road. The charred remains of an old pickup truck, brightened by a pristine American flag draped over the cab. Desperate residents fleeing, cars packed with people and family heirlooms, anything that could be frantically scooped up.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/14warfire-promo/merlin_146799231_c44c8713-935b-40b2-9869-274de82e37dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/14/us/14warfire-promo/merlin_146799231_c44c8713-935b-40b2-9869-274de82e37dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/14warfire-promo/merlin_146799231_c44c8713-935b-40b2-9869-274de82e37dc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/14warfire-promo/merlin_146799231_c44c8713-935b-40b2-9869-274de82e37dc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/14warfire-promo/merlin_146799231_c44c8713-935b-40b2-9869-274de82e37dc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/14/us/14warfire-promo/merlin_146799231_c44c8713-935b-40b2-9869-274de82e37dc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbna