26332ddd'}, {'abstract': '“The problem is that Emmanuel suffers from a very low Approval Rating in France, 26%,” wrote President Trump, whose approval rating in France is 9 percent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/13/us/politics/trump-macron-france.html', 'snippet': '“The problem is that Emmanuel suffers from a very low Approval Rating in France, 26%,” wrote President Trump, whose approval rating in France is 9 percent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump issued a blistering personal attack on Tuesday against President Emmanuel Macron of France, his host last weekend, and sought to douse a furor over his decision not to visit a cemetery of American soldiers while in France because of rain.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/politics/14dc-prexy/merlin_146608938_58273596-0c32-42c8-859d-e0d322b85e46-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/14/us/politics/14dc-prexy/merlin_146608938_58273596-0c32-42c8-859d-e0d322b85e46-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/politics/14dc-prexy/merlin_146608938_58273596-0c32-42c8-859d-e0d322b85e46-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/politics/14dc-prexy/merlin_146608938_58273596-0c32-42c8-859d-e0d322b85e46-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/politics/14dc-pr