for cybersecurity jobs aren’t easy to learn in the classroom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/14/opinion/cybersecurity-education-skills.html', 'snippet': 'The skills needed for cybersecurity jobs aren’t easy to learn in the classroom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Between September 2017 and August 2018, employers in the United States posted 313,735 job openings for cybersecurity professionals. Filling those jobs would mean increasing the country’s current cybersecurity work force of 715,000 people by more than 40 percent, according to data presented at the National Initiative for Cybersecurity Education Conference this month. With the number of unfilled cybersecurity jobs worldwide projected to multiply into the millions in the next three years, it’s no surprise that governments, companies and schools are racing to pour more resources into cybersecurity training and education programs. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/opinion/14WOLFF/merlin_140254542_f52cc9a7-a345-4c12-82e2-52dcdf888c7b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/14/opinion/14WOLFF/merlin_140254542_f52cc9a7-a345-4c12-82e2-52dcdf888c7b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/opinion/14WOLFF/merlin_140254542_f52cc9a7-a345-4c12-82e2-52dcdf888c7b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/opinion/14WOLFF/merlin_140254542_f52cc9a7-a345-4c12-82e2-52dcdf888c7b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':