 Hudson Valley and a 1911 estate in St. Louis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/14/realestate/1-4-million-homes-in-massachusetts-new-york-and-missouri.html', 'snippet': 'A condominium in an 1898 schoolhouse outside Boston, an 1840 Carpenter Gothic house in the Hudson Valley and a 1911 estate in St. Louis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This home is in the Spring Hill historic district in the center of Somerville, about five miles from downtown Boston. It is less than a mile from the T stop and commuter rail at Porter Square, in Cambridge, and slightly more than a mile from Harvard Square. The building was converted into apartments in 1980 and became a condominium in 1997. Joe Perry, the lead guitarist of Aerosmith, lived in this unit before it went condo.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-E8PS/18WYG-slide-E8PS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-E8PS/18WYG-slide-E8PS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-E8PS/18WYG-slide-E8PS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-E8PS/18WYG-slide-E8PS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-E8PS/18WYG-slide-E8PS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard