a0a4cbc2c656', 'word_count': 1454, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44f8f9d6-ef17-5fe2-81cc-a0a4cbc2c656'}, {'abstract': 'The agency jettisons expert panels providing guidance on important health and environmental issues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/14/opinion/environment-trump-epa-science.html', 'snippet': 'The agency jettisons expert panels providing guidance on important health and environmental issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month, the Environmental Protection Agency effectively disbanded a scientific panel of experts on microscopic airborne pollutants that helped the agency figure out what level of pollutants are safe to breathe. The agency also dropped plans for a similar panel of experts to help assess another dangerous pollutant, ground-level ozone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/autossell/00ZARBA/merlin_117542744_65a2ad1a-3c50-4be8-b790-d0d6daf9f7bc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/13/autossell/00ZARBA/merlin_117542744_65a2ad1a-3c50-4be8-b790-d0d6daf9f7bc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/autossell/00ZARBA/merlin_117542744_65a2ad1a-3c50-4be8-b790-d0d6daf9f7bc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 620, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/autossell/00ZARBA/merlin_117542744_65a2ad1a-3c50-4be8-b790-d0d6daf9f7bc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1240, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/autossell/00ZARBA/merlin_1175