yptian revival (but the ’70s version); scenes from the Memphis movement; references to pre-Columbian pottery, and to early ’80s disco tropes and Pop Art; many, many objects emblazoned with marijuana leaves (including a stunning beaded and embroidered textile that read “Weed” in a medley of greens); and an elderly and very grumpy Chihuahua atop a lavender towel on a shredded lime-colored chair.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/fashion/15ADLER1/merlin_146520348_12bb4876-1697-48b8-9cef-b2627f91c3d4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/15/fashion/15ADLER1/merlin_146520348_12bb4876-1697-48b8-9cef-b2627f91c3d4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/fashion/15ADLER1/merlin_146520348_12bb4876-1697-48b8-9cef-b2627f91c3d4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/fashion/15ADLER1/merlin_146520348_12bb4876-1697-48b8-9cef-b2627f91c3d4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/fashion/15ADLER1/15ADLER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/15/fashion/15ADLER1/15ADLER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/