and political crises after Germany’s growth disappointed and Italy defied calls to modify a populist budget plan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/14/business/german-economy-shrinks.html', 'snippet': 'The Continent faces a confluence of economic and political crises after Germany’s growth disappointed and Italy defied calls to modify a populist budget plan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — Germany’s once unstoppable economy has gone into reverse, adding another threat to European stability just as Italy escalated its dispute with fiscal overseers in Brussels.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/business/15GERMANYITALY01/merlin_87166289_b0a66f0d-4962-47bc-b829-53dd4049cf5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/15/business/15GERMANYITALY01/merlin_87166289_b0a66f0d-4962-47bc-b829-53dd4049cf5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/business/15GERMANYITALY01/merlin_87166289_b0a66f0d-4962-47bc-b829-53dd4049cf5b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/business/15GERMANYITALY01/merlin_87166289_b0a66f0d-4962-47bc-b829-53dd4049cf5b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/business/15GERMANYITALY01/15GERMANYITALY01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/15/business/15GERMANYITALY01/15GERMANYITALY01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/15/business/15GERMANYITALY01/15GERMANYITALY01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'German Economy Shrinks Unexpectedly, Adding to Europe’s Risk', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sudden Decline in German Economy Adds to Europe’s Risk', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Commission', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Five Star Movement (Italy)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eurozone', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brussels (Belgium)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-14T20:50:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f23bebce-c7ac-51dc-bcca-5624612590af', 'word_count': 698, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f23bebce-c7ac-51dc-bcca-5624612590af'}, {'abstract': 'John Houck’s visual trickery; Svenja Deininger’s “Crescendo” paintings; Didier William’s eye-catching mixed-media works; and the poet John Ashbery’s demure treasures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/14/arts/design/what-to-see-in-new-york-art-galleries-this-week.html', 'snippet': 'John Houck’s visual trickery; Svenja Deininger’s “Crescendo” paintings; Didier William’s eye-catching mixed-media works; and the poet John Ashbery’s demure treasures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Los Angeles photographer John Houck creates multiple layers of visual trickery in deceptively simple still lifes by shooting and reshooting life-size color prints that he alters as he goes. In “Accumulator #20, 3 Colors #B2DAE5, #B4867B, #B46E5C,” for example, the diptych that opens his first solo show at Marianne Boesky’s New York gallery, “Holding Environment,” he folded the prints before reshooting to incorporate vivid trompe l’oeil creases, complete with graded shadows, in the final images. But the actual prints on display, carefully floated behind glass, are also creased, and it’s the difficulty of distinguishing the “real” folds from the illusory ones that gives the work its substance. What other deceptive appearances, you have to wonder, have taken you in on your way into the gallery?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/arts/16galleries-Deininger/merlin_146238684_35765f44-c174-4105-a580-9abcab45cd05-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/16/arts/16galleries-Deininger/merlin_146238684_35765f44-c174-4105-a580-9abcab45cd05-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 629}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url':