ay the U.S. needs to push back.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/14/world/asia/usa-china-trade-pacific.html', 'snippet': 'Trump administration officials are anxious about Beijing’s efforts to assert dominance over Taiwan, the South China Sea and far Pacific islands. They say the U.S. needs to push back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Trade disputes have for months been the focus of souring relations between the United States and China. But intractable problems in the South China Sea and the Taiwan Strait underscore that competition for dominance of the Pacific Ocean remains the most volatile source of conflict between the two nations — and the tensions are rising.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/politics/16dc-china-print/merlin_143384550_f3a150b3-e04d-42ba-839e-5359c23356e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/16/us/politics/16dc-china-print/merlin_143384550_f3a150b3-e04d-42ba-839e-5359c23356e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/politics/16dc-china-print/merlin_143384550_f3a150b3-e04d-42ba-839e-5359c23356e5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/politics/16dc-china-print/merlin_143384550_f3a150b3-e04d-42ba-839e-5359c23356e5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/politics/16dc-china-print/15dc