51', 'word_count': 803, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75e7c96e-9535-5854-9c2e-c39ac4ed0751'}, {'abstract': 'With thousands of homes destroyed in the wildfires, the homeless crisis just got worse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/15/us/homeless-california-wildfires-evacuees.html', 'snippet': 'With thousands of homes destroyed in the wildfires, the homeless crisis just got worse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICO, Calif. — Within hours of the flames igniting in Northern California last week, an instant new homeless crisis was born. In a state already suffering an acute housing shortage, the fire that swept through the town of Paradise and neighboring hamlets has once again laid bare one of California’s biggest vulnerabilities: With each disaster — wildfire, mudslide or earthquake — there are thousands of people who cannot find homes in a market that for years has had very little vacancy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16housing-promo/merlin_146842419_d6b2b368-ffcc-4818-a4d5-9d72c1b54cea-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16housing-promo/merlin_146842419_d6b2b368-ffcc-4818-a4d5-9d72c1b54cea-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16housing-promo/merlin_146842419_d6b2b368-ffcc-4818-a4d5-9d72c1b54cea-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16housing-promo/merlin_146842419_d6b2b368-ffcc-4818-a4d5-9d72c1b54cea-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'supe