-80aeeffbee55'}, {'abstract': 'The proposed legislation is very much a modest compromise, one that will result in about 7,000 federal inmates getting out early.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/16/us/prison-reform-bill.html', 'snippet': 'The proposed legislation is very much a modest compromise, one that will result in about 7,000 federal inmates getting out early.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of those seeking to overhaul the nation’s criminal justice system want to cut the prison population by more than a million inmates. An agreement in Washington this week, hailed as a landmark bipartisan moment, falls well short of that: about 7,000 people might get out early.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16compromise/merlin_93905228_1f76dc84-c69d-4cf2-9eb6-d1c8a605a3e7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16compromise/merlin_93905228_1f76dc84-c69d-4cf2-9eb6-d1c8a605a3e7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16compromise/merlin_93905228_1f76dc84-c69d-4cf2-9eb6-d1c8a605a3e7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16compromise/merlin_93905228_1f76dc84-c69d-4cf2-9eb6-d1c8a605a3e7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/16/us/16compromise/16compromise-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbn