, {'abstract': 'Among famous figures in sports, entertainment and politics, Ms. Adelson, a prominent Republican donor and the wife of the casino magnate Sheldon Adelson, stands out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/16/us/politics/presidential-medal-freedom-adelson.html', 'snippet': 'Among famous figures in sports, entertainment and politics, Ms. Adelson, a prominent Republican donor and the wife of the casino magnate Sheldon Adelson, stands out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump on Friday awarded the Presidential Medal of Freedom, the nation’s highest civilian commendation, to an eclectic mix of honorees from the worlds of sports, entertainment, law and politics, including two of the most famous names of the last century, Babe Ruth and Elvis Presley.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Awards Medals of Freedom to Elvis, Babe Ruth and Miriam Adelson', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Among Medal of Freedom Honorees, a Big Donor Stands Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Medal of Freedom', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidents and Presidency (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adelson, Miriam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hatch, Orrin G', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Page, Alan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Presley, Elvis', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Staubach, Roger', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ruth, Babe', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scalia, Antonin', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N