ty to do before the holiday coming up: Make some cranberry sauce, stock, pie dough — maybe some cornbread stuffing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/16/dining/what-to-cook-this-weekend.html', 'snippet': 'There’s plenty to do before the holiday coming up: Make some cranberry sauce, stock, pie dough — maybe some cornbread stuffing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. It has been a long and terrible week for many of us — in California, especially, still burning, smoky, grieving, raw. The nation hurts for those who lost their lives, their homes, their animals, their sense of community, their communities themselves. Whatever you cook this weekend in advance of the coming Thanksgiving feast, whatever you do to bring lightness into your life at a time when darkness abounds, please keep in mind those who are or have been in harm’s way. Here is what you can do to help.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/magazine/04eat1/04eat1-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/01/04/magazine/04eat1/04eat1-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/magazine/04eat1/04eat1-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/magazine/04eat1/04eat1-superJumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 1429, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/01/04/magazine/04eat1/04eat1-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_nam