site let Ms. Riesman indulge her love of movies but also showed her early prescience about the power of the internet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/16/obituaries/mayra-langdon-riesman-dead.html', 'snippet': 'The Film Scouts website let Ms. Riesman indulge her love of movies but also showed her early prescience about the power of the internet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayra Langdon Riesman, who in the mid-1990s turned her fascination with movies into Film Scouts, an early and ambitious website that offered film festival coverage, movie reviews, trailers and interviews with Hollywood personalities, died on Nov. 4 at her home in Manhattan. She was 64.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/17/obituaries/17RIESMAN-OBIT/merlin_146883597_33aeef59-141a-4add-ace2-6ce77d05b1ac-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 814, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/17/obituaries/17RIESMAN-OBIT/merlin_146883597_33aeef59-141a-4add-ace2-6ce77d05b1ac-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 814}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/17/obituaries/17RIESMAN-OBIT/merlin_146883597_33aeef59-141a-4add-ace2-6ce77d05b1ac-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 755, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/17/obituaries/17RIESMAN-OBIT/merlin_146883597_33aeef59-141a-4add-ace2-6ce77d05b1ac-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1510, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/17/obituaries/17RIESMAN-OBIT/16RIESMAN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'