o) of natural disasters, some people are rethinking what it means to be green and charitable during the holiday season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It didn’t take long after Hurricane Sandy swept through New York in late 2012 for holiday shoppers to return to downtown boutiques and Fifth Avenue stores. I, on the other hand, stayed home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/00xp-holiday2/merlin_31906117_10ba11b3-b64e-4f5c-a4d3-fede24552c15-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/14/us/00xp-holiday2/merlin_31906117_10ba11b3-b64e-4f5c-a4d3-fede24552c15-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/00xp-holiday2/merlin_31906117_10ba11b3-b64e-4f5c-a4d3-fede24552c15-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/00xp-holiday2/merlin_31906117_10ba11b3-b64e-4f5c-a4d3-fede24552c15-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1352, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/00xp-holiday2/00xp-holiday2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/14/us/00xp-holiday2/00xp-holiday2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/14/us/00xp-holiday2/00xp-holiday2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLar