7, 'uri': 'nyt://article/513dd505-b4f1-5f72-b746-f944293a0f53'}, {'abstract': 'Donald Trump was conspicuously absent from an annual economic forum in the Pacific.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/18/opinion/apec-summit-trump.html', 'snippet': 'Donald Trump was conspicuously absent from an annual economic forum in the Pacific.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump kept his distance from the United States’ traditional allies by avoiding this year’s Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation summit. He sent Vice President Mike Pence to the meeting in Port Moresby, Papua New Guinea, in his place.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/19/opinion/19heng-inyt/19heng-inyt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/19/opinion/19heng-inyt/19heng-inyt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 436}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/19/opinion/19heng-inyt/19heng-inyt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/19/opinion/19heng-inyt/19heng-inyt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1489, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/19/opinion/19heng-inyt/19heng-inyt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/19/opinion/19heng-inyt/19heng-inyt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'u