ith tomato soup and grilled cheese, or a pan-roasted fish fillet. And save your energy for the feast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/19/dining/what-to-cook-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'Keep it simple, with tomato soup and grilled cheese, or a pan-roasted fish fillet. And save your energy for the feast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. It’s been days and days and I’m still thinking about that wet snow that fell on Thursday last week, how it crippled the New York metropolitan area, how I was in my car for five hours that night, trying to make it to a reading in Pelham Bay Park, then trying to get home when it was canceled because three hours into my drive from Manhattan I was only in the South Bronx. I crawled and crawled. Total mileage for all those hours: 28 miles.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/dining/tomato-soup/tomato-soup-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/10/dining/tomato-soup/tomato-soup-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/dining/tomato-soup/tomato-soup-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/dining/tomato-soup/tomato-soup-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/dining/tomato-soup/tomato-soup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/10/dining/tomato-soup/tomato-soup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/dining/tomato-soup/tomato-soup-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Cook Right Now', 'kicker': 'What to Cook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-19T15:30:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/315e4c44-8ec0-59ed-b783-b82131021e6e', 'word_count': 668, 'uri': 'nyt://article/315e4c44-8ec0-59ed-b783-b82131021e6e'}, {'abstract': 'The novelist, who died on Friday, later found his voice as a screenwriter and teller of Hollywood tales.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/19/movies/william-goldman-remembrance.html', 'snippet': 'The novelist, who died on Friday, later found his voice as a screenwriter and teller of Hollywood tales.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William Goldman’s first novel, “The Temple of Gold,” was published in 1957. In the part of the timeline of American cultural history devoted to expressions of youthful male restlessness, that’s exactly between “Rebel Without a Cause” and “Goodbye, Columbus” and roughly coincident with “On the Road.” The literature of the period in particular bristles with the energy of young men in revolt against the expectations of their parents and the stultifying conventions of postwar society.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/arts/25goldman-appraisal2/merlin_146750058_68bff5ca-ff75-4ca2-916e-29ab764649a6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/25/arts/25goldman-appraisal2/merlin_146750058_68bff5ca-ff75-4ca2-916e-29ab764649a6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/arts/25goldman-appraisal2/merlin_146750058_68bff5ca-ff75-4ca2-916e-29ab764649a6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/arts/25goldman-appraisal2/merlin_146750058_68bff5ca-ff75-4ca2-916e-29ab764649a6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1349, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/arts/25goldman-appraisal2/25goldman-appraisal2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/25/arts/25goldman-appraisal2/25goldman-appraisal2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/arts/25goldman-appraisal2/25goldman-appraisal2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'William Goldman’s Journey From Page to Screen', 'kicker': 'An Appraisal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Writer Who Found His Voice in the Movies', 'name': None, 'seo'