': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/19/arts/20xp-globe/20xp-globe-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/19/arts/20xp-globe/20xp-globe-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Marilyn Monroe’s Golden Globe Fetches $250,000', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Monroe’s Golden Globe Sells for $250,000', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hollywood Foreign Press Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Monroe, Marilyn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-19T21:28:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura M. Holson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'First Chapter', '_id': 'nyt://article/069a1ee1-4cfc-5f8f-b5f3-a704b4a67baf', 'word_count': 558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/069a1ee1-4cfc-5f8f-b5f3-a704b4a67baf'}, {'abstract': 'Mother Wit Cluckity Chicken Bone Broth, from the chef behind the Pandering Pig in Upper Manhattan, is rich and deeply flavorful.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/19/dining/chicken-stock-mother-wit.html', 'snippet': 'Mother Wit Cluckity Chicken Bone Broth, from the chef behind the Pandering Pig in Upper Manhattan, is rich and deeply flavorful.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The minute there’s a nip in the air, the broths, and particularly bone broths these days, emerge. Here’s a new one that I would not hesitate to shamelessly call my own. Mother Wit is the brand, and it’s owned by Nicole O’Brien, a self-taught chef who owns the Pandering Pig, a tiny Franco-Californian bistro in Upper Manhattan where the rich, deeply flavored organic chicken broth is made. It’s sold frozen, in 32-ounce pouches. Soon it will be joined by a vegan broth fortified with tomato, and by spring, beef bone broth will join the line.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/21burner5/merlin_146762406_d4f47b82-dc9d-4466-af3a-a04c67b8d6ca-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 460, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/21burner5/merlin_146762406_d4f47b82-dc9d-4466-af3a-a04c67b8d6ca-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 460}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/21burner5/merlin_146762406_d4f47b82-dc9d-4466-af3a-a04c67b8d6ca-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 785, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/21burner5/merlin_146762406_d4f47b82-dc9d-4466-af3a-a04c67b8d6ca-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1569, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/21burner5/21burner5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/21/dining/21burner5/21burner5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credi