e contentious midterm elections, it may be inevitable that your angry uncle or radical niece will turn talk to the campaigns, the migrant caravan or George Soros. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/21/us/politics/fact-check-thanksgiving-politics.html', 'snippet': 'With the holiday on the heels of the contentious midterm elections, it may be inevitable that your angry uncle or radical niece will turn talk to the campaigns, the migrant caravan or George Soros. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The turkey has been carved, the potatoes mashed, the wine poured. And someone who has had one too many drinks, perhaps inevitably, utters two words. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/us/politics/22dc-factcheck-promo/merlin_147120039_87ea8713-c24e-4ea4-9d69-0d95a05b4ee2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/22/us/politics/22dc-factcheck-promo/merlin_147120039_87ea8713-c24e-4ea4-9d69-0d95a05b4ee2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/us/politics/22dc-factcheck-promo/merlin_147120039_87ea8713-c24e-4ea4-9d69-0d95a05b4ee2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/us/politics/22dc-factcheck-promo/merlin_147120039_87ea8713-c24e-4ea4-9d69-0d95a05b4ee2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/us/politics/22dc-factcheck-promo/22dc-factcheck-promo-thum