ank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-21T10:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Concepción de León', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Concepción', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'de León', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/303b5446-467b-565a-a300-3f99570ecac6', 'word_count': 1317, 'uri': 'nyt://article/303b5446-467b-565a-a300-3f99570ecac6'}, {'abstract': 'Shetland Wool Week is hailed as the worldwide mecca of knitting festivals. But the islands have a rich, complex history beyond that of the textiles industry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/21/travel/shetland-islands-wool-week-knitting.html', 'snippet': 'Shetland Wool Week is hailed as the worldwide mecca of knitting festivals. But the islands have a rich, complex history beyond that of the textiles industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last fall, just a few days into my trip to the Shetland Islands, the Scottish subarctic archipelago across the sea from Norway, I found myself on the top of a cliff face, peering through the fog at a huge rock in the northern Atlantic Ocean. The rock was topped with a spike of white: the Muckle Flugga lighthouse, built in 1854, a mind-boggling feat as the rock’s cliff face juts straight up out of the roiling sea. In the early days of the lighthouse, our tour guide told us, men had to be hoisted by ropes around their arms to safely cross the gap between their boat and the landing area on the rock. At this most northerly point in the U.K, I felt a profound sense that I was very far from home.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/travel/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01/merlin_145178070_d4e7701f-d91e-4983-8630-5a13f857e159-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 334, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/13/travel/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01/merlin_145178070_d4e7701f-d91e-4983-8630-5a13f857e159-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 334}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/travel/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01/merlin_145178070_d4e7701f-d91e-4983-8630-5a13f857e159-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 571, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/travel/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01/merlin_145178070_d4e7701f-d91e-4983-8630-5a13f857e159-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1141, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/travel/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/13/travel/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/13/travel/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01/00Scotland-Assynt-HeadsUp-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shetland Islands: Scenery, Sheep and Knitters Galore on Britain’s Northern Tip', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wind, Scenery, Sheep and Knitters Galore', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wool and Woolen Goods', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Knitting and Knit Goods', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sheep', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shetland Islands (Scotland)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-21T10:00:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nellie Hermann', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nellie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hermann', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c124953-7148-57ac-b816-aed613554237', 'word_count': 2468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c124953-7148-57ac-b816-aed613554237'}, {'abstract': 'A small enclave with a big personality, this riverside neighborhood is a “live-and-let-live kind of place.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2018/11/21/realestate/living-in-snedens-landing-palisades-ny.html', 'snippet': 'A small enclave with a big personality, this riverside neighborhood is a “live-and-let-live kind of place.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A small enclave with a big personality, this riverside neighborhood is a “live-and-let-live kind of place.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/realestate/25LIVINGIN-PALISADES-slide-LACI/25LIVINGIN-PALISADES-slide-LACI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/25/realestate/25LIVINGIN-PALISADES-slide-LACI/25LIVINGIN-PALISADES-slide-LACI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/realestate/25LIVINGIN-PALISADES-slide-LACI/25LIVINGIN-PALISADES-slide