isks. That safeguard looks set to be weakened next year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good Wednesday. The briefing will be taking a break on Thursday and Friday, but look out for a special China-focused edition on Sunday. (Want this by email? Sign up here.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/business/dealbookemail/22db-newsletter-stoxx/merlin_147132834_760e4a69-ac6b-4020-88de-55a171ec3fba-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/22/business/dealbookemail/22db-newsletter-stoxx/merlin_147132834_760e4a69-ac6b-4020-88de-55a171ec3fba-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/business/dealbookemail/22db-newsletter-stoxx/merlin_147132834_760e4a69-ac6b-4020-88de-55a171ec3fba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/business/dealbookemail/22db-newsletter-stoxx/merlin_147132834_760e4a69-ac6b-4020-88de-55a171ec3fba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/22/business/dealbookemail/22db-newsletter-stoxx/merlin_147132834_760e4a69-ac6b-4020-88de-55a171ec3fba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/22/business/dealbookemail/22db-newsletter-stoxx/merlin_147132834_760e4a69-ac6b-4020-88de-55a171ec3fba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'ca