: 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a78e2e9-111f-5e18-81f6-7970eaf303fc', 'word_count': 1149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a78e2e9-111f-5e18-81f6-7970eaf303fc'}, {'abstract': 'The exchange with reporters was a notable deviation on a Thanksgiving that was otherwise almost an exact replica of how the president spent the holiday last year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/22/us/politics/trump-saudi-thanksgiving.html', 'snippet': 'The exchange with reporters was a notable deviation on a Thanksgiving that was otherwise almost an exact replica of how the president spent the holiday last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. — President Trump on Thursday rebuffed the C.I.A. over its conclusion that the Saudi crown prince was responsible for the killing of Jamal Khashoggi, saying the agency merely had “feelings” on the matter, and he threatened to close the entire southern border if a caravan that is so far waiting patiently on the Mexican side grows “uncontrollable.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/us/politics/23dc-trump-print/23dc-trump-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/23/us/politics/23dc-trump-print/23dc-trump-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/us/politics/23dc-trump-print/23dc-trump-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/us/politics/23dc-trump-print/23dc-trump-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'ra