riginal': 'By Emily Cochrane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cochrane', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50f31473-7f88-5c30-bbfc-1e96604d73e0', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50f31473-7f88-5c30-bbfc-1e96604d73e0'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Peralta served 16 years in the State Legislature but lost in a September primary as part of a breakaway group of Democrats who caucused with Republicans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/22/nyregion/jose-peralta-dominican-american-senator-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Peralta served 16 years in the State Legislature but lost in a September primary as part of a breakaway group of Democrats who caucused with Republicans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'José R. Peralta, the first Dominican-American elected to the New York State Senate, died on Wednesday night in a hospital in Queens, where he represented a diverse constituency. He was 47.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/nyregion/23peralta/merlin_61893770_1111b87b-0390-40fe-b0ce-d087f0f74fdb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/23/nyregion/23peralta/merlin_61893770_1111b87b-0390-40fe-b0ce-d087f0f74fdb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/nyregion/23peralta/merlin_61893770_1111b87b-0390-40fe-b0ce-d087f0f74fdb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/nyregion/23pe