pg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/business/08CHEAPFLIGHTS-01/08CHEAPFLIGHTS-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/08/business/08CHEAPFLIGHTS-01/08CHEAPFLIGHTS-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/08/business/08CHEAPFLIGHTS-01/08CHEAPFLIGHTS-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Good Cheap Flights Still Exist. Here’s How to Find Them.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Good Cheap Flights Still Exist. Here’s How to Find Them.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search Engines', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-22T22:57:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Wichter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wichter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/55250157-64d2-5cf7-80f2-7aad2dbb8b10', 'word_count': 1013, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55250157-64d2-5cf7-80f2-7aad2dbb8b10'}, {'abstract': 'James changed free agency forever the first time he left Cleveland. His second departure from the Cavaliers, for Los Angeles, shows how much he has changed, too.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/22/sports/basketball/lebron-james-cleveland-lakers.html', 'snippet': 'James changed free agency forever the first time he left Cleveland. His second departure from the Cavaliers, for Los Angeles, shows how much he has changed, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLEVELAND — The Los Angeles Lakers are not a great team, but they employ the greatest player in the world. They seem to be grasping the potential benefits of such an arrangement. LeBron James can compensate for many problems: lackluster defense, questionable decisions, growing pains.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/sports/23lebron-web07/merlin_147183921_b7972ab6-2f24-4303-9e2f-83add346ed8d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/23/sports/23lebron-web07/merlin_147183921_b7972ab6-2f24-4303-9e2f-83add346ed8d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/sports/23lebron-web07/merlin_147183921_b7972ab6-2f24-4303-9e2f-83add346ed8d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/sports/23lebron-web07/merlin_147183921_b7972ab6-2f24-4303-9e2f-83add346ed8d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/23/sports/23lebron-