and fitness entrepreneur always packs a meditation pillow and three computers (but he leaves his socks and underwear behind).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/23/travel/what-steve-aoki-cant-travel-without.html', 'snippet': 'The globe-trotting D.J. and fitness entrepreneur always packs a meditation pillow and three computers (but he leaves his socks and underwear behind).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steve Aoki lives in Las Vegas, but that’s little more than a technicality. The electro-house D.J. is constantly on the road, playing between 200 and 300 shows a year. In addition to his career in music, Mr. Aoki has developed a fitness regimen, Aoki Bootcamp, which he posts on Instagram so his fans can follow his high-intensity interval workouts no matter if he is in China or New York. His NEO U app, based on his personal fitness program, launched in October.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/travel/25carryon-aoki-A/merlin_147075069_f18b15a4-65be-40a3-b1eb-033207b7799a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/25/travel/25carryon-aoki-A/merlin_147075069_f18b15a4-65be-40a3-b1eb-033207b7799a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/travel/25carryon-aoki-A/merlin_147075069_f18b15a4-65be-40a3-b1eb-033207b7799a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/25/travel/25carryon-aoki-A/merlin_147075069_f18b15a4-65be-40a3-b1eb-033207b7799a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo',