as a child in Tulsa, Okla., during an attack on a black section of the city in 1921. She later broke a racial barrier for the Coast Guard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/23/obituaries/olivia-hooker-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She was a child in Tulsa, Okla., during an attack on a black section of the city in 1921. She later broke a racial barrier for the Coast Guard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Olivia Hooker, who after surviving a race-related attack on a black section of Tulsa, Okla., in 1921 went on to become the first black woman to enlist in the Coast Guard and a distinguished psychology professor at Fordham University, died on Wednesday at her home in White Plains, N.Y. She was 103.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/obituaries/24hooker-obit1/merlin_147168300_2389ed4c-05bd-471f-8ad3-46e34237252a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/24/obituaries/24hooker-obit1/merlin_147168300_2389ed4c-05bd-471f-8ad3-46e34237252a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 434}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/obituaries/24hooker-obit1/merlin_147168300_2389ed4c-05bd-471f-8ad3-46e34237252a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/obituaries/24hooker-obit1/merlin_147168300_2389ed4c-05bd-471f-8ad3-46e34237252a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1480, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/obituaries/24hooker-obit1/00hooke