20-80c0-f91a5c92c4fc'}, {'abstract': 'In 2021 Rutgers will get a big payday from the Big Ten. Will it be enough to justify years of lousy football, or balance the budget? ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/23/sports/rutgers-big-ten.html', 'snippet': 'In 2021 Rutgers will get a big payday from the Big Ten. Will it be enough to justify years of lousy football, or balance the budget? ', 'lead_paragraph': 'PISCATAWAY, N.J. — A cup of whiskey in hand, Kevin Zitko, the deputy chief for the Washington Township Fire Department, sat inside his decommissioned fire truck outside Gate B of HighPoint.com Stadium on a recent Saturday. He laughed as Rutgers fans motioned for him to turn on the siren and flash the lights. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/sports/24rutgers4-print/merlin_146794137_8853753d-25a3-4917-963e-ae63fcb46970-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/24/sports/24rutgers4-print/merlin_146794137_8853753d-25a3-4917-963e-ae63fcb46970-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/sports/24rutgers4-print/merlin_146794137_8853753d-25a3-4917-963e-ae63fcb46970-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/sports/24rutgers4-print/merlin_146794137_8853753d-25a3-4917-963e-ae63fcb46970-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/24/sports/24rutg