h Korean Movement To Change Minds on Beauty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '#MeToo Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty (Concept)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Plastic Surgery', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's Rights", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-23T21:47:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Stevenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stevenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f7ddd63-ce8b-5420-b33a-ab6c1c55c141', 'word_count': 1230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f7ddd63-ce8b-5420-b33a-ab6c1c55c141'}, {'abstract': 'Centrist leaders in Europe have cut migration to Europe by about 90 percent already, using the kinds of deterrents belatedly recommended by Hillary Clinton.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/23/world/europe/hillary-clinton-migrants-immigration-europe.html', 'snippet': 'Centrist leaders in Europe have cut migration to Europe by about 90 percent already, using the kinds of deterrents belatedly recommended by Hillary Clinton.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — When Hillary Clinton warned in an interview this week that Europe’s centrist leadership needed to “get a handle” on migration, or risk further fanning the flames of populism, some wondered where she had been the last few years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page':