uri': 'nyt://article/1f073316-5343-5f33-a895-86ac3e7683cf'}, {'abstract': 'Dayton, Ohio, had one of the highest overdose death rates in the nation in 2017. The city made many changes, and fatal overdoses are down more than 50 percent from last year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/25/health/opioid-overdose-deaths-dayton.html', 'snippet': 'Dayton, Ohio, had one of the highest overdose death rates in the nation in 2017. The city made many changes, and fatal overdoses are down more than 50 percent from last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAYTON, Ohio — Dr. Randy Marriott clicked open the daily report he gets on drug overdoses in the county. Only one in the last 24 hours — stunningly low compared to the long lists he used to scroll through last year in a grim morning routine.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/25/science/00DAYTON8/merlin_145795194_b54eeaf4-c091-4d39-a73b-57f99b0b1e6c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/10/25/science/00DAYTON8/merlin_145795194_b54eeaf4-c091-4d39-a73b-57f99b0b1e6c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/25/science/00DAYTON8/merlin_145795194_b54eeaf4-c091-4d39-a73b-57f99b0b1e6c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/25/science/00DAYTON8/merlin_145795194_b54eeaf4-c091-4d39-a73b-57f99b0b1e6c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',