d out en masse for the follow-up to “Wreck-It Ralph” and the eighth chapter in the “Rocky” series.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/25/movies/ralph-breaks-the-internet-creed-ii-thanksgiving-box-office.html', 'snippet': 'Sequelitis? Not this weekend. Movie audiences turned out en masse for the follow-up to “Wreck-It Ralph” and the eighth chapter in the “Rocky” series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Thanksgiving movie audiences stuck with the equivalent of grandma’s green beans almondine — the tried and true. A well-reviewed sequel from Walt Disney Animation, “Ralph Breaks the Internet,” sold the most tickets, followed by “Creed II,” the eighth film in the “Rocky” series.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/26/movies/26box1/merlin_146949582_4601c291-080b-46d0-af72-1a7653909b0a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/26/movies/26box1/merlin_146949582_4601c291-080b-46d0-af72-1a7653909b0a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/26/movies/26box1/merlin_146949582_4601c291-080b-46d0-af72-1a7653909b0a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/26/movies/26box1/merlin_146949582_4601c291-080b-46d0-af72-1a7653909b0a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 858, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/26/movies/26box1/26box1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbna