n Ysidro stems, in part, from confusion over what legal status, if any, migrants are entitled to from the Trump administration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/26/us/politics/migrants-border-trump-.html', 'snippet': 'The discord at San Ysidro stems, in part, from confusion over what legal status, if any, migrants are entitled to from the Trump administration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tear gas and the temporary closing of the San Ysidro border crossing in Southern California marked an early confrontation between a caravan of migrants desperate to enter the United States and the governments of America and Mexico trying to hold them back.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/us/politics/27dc-border-print/merlin_147346146_dc8ed680-faa1-405b-a2f5-26df322ee404-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/27/us/politics/27dc-border-print/merlin_147346146_dc8ed680-faa1-405b-a2f5-26df322ee404-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/us/politics/27dc-border-print/merlin_147346146_dc8ed680-faa1-405b-a2f5-26df322ee404-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/us/politics/27dc-border-print/merlin_147346146_dc8ed680-faa1-405b-a2f5-26df322ee404-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/us/politics/27dc-border-print/27dc-border-thumbStandard.jpg', 'h