3c0-515c-b42e-128331581b45'}, {'abstract': 'For over 50 years, the photographer Kwame Brathwaite captured African-American beauty and fashion, giving visual power to black power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/27/lens/kwame-brathwaite-black-is-beautiful.html', 'snippet': 'For over 50 years, the photographer Kwame Brathwaite captured African-American beauty and fashion, giving visual power to black power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The intersection of West 125th Street and Seventh Avenue in Harlem was, for decades, a center of black nationalism. Street orators — that’s what they were called — climbed onto stepladders and made impassioned calls for African liberation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/lens/27Brathwaite1/27Brathwaite1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/27/lens/27Brathwaite1/27Brathwaite1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/lens/27Brathwaite1/27Brathwaite1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/lens/27Brathwaite1/27Brathwaite1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1775, 'width': 1775, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/27/lens/27Brathwaite1/27Brathwaite1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/27/lens/27Brathwaite1/27Brathwaite1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {