 about your not wanting to have a child, and then your struggles once you did. It’s also your first Broadway show, after a history of performing in smaller venues. How do you like being in a bigger theater? My recurring nightmare was me, onstage, in this 1,100-seat theater, with no people in it. I’ve had it ever since we even talked about doing the show on Broadway. Strangely enough, that became a reality in rehearsal, because it’s just the designers and the crew in the audience. There’s eight people in a room that seats 1,100, and so I do the show from start to finish with no laughter. It’s really empowering to live your nightmare.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '70', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-talk-image2/02mag-talk-image2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-talk-image2/02mag-talk-image2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-talk-image2/02mag-talk-image2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-talk-image2/02mag-talk-image2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-talk-image2/02mag-talk-image2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-talk-image2/02mag-talk-image2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-talk-image2/02mag-talk-image2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mike Birbiglia Thinks You Don’t Know How to Tell a Story', 'kicker': 'Talk', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mike Birbiglia Thinks You Don’t Know How to Tell a Story', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The New One (Play)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-28T10:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'Interview by Dan Amira', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Interview', 'middlename': 'Dan', 'lastname': 'Amira', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18cce944-f9da-5bb6-8efc-7dbebce27e60', 'word_count': 710, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18cce944-f9da-5bb6-8efc-7dbebce27e60'}, {'abstract': 'Tariffs on Chinese imports have endangered small business around the United States — a growing nightmare that critics say the president could have avoided.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/28/magazine/trade-war-tariffs-small-business.html', 'snippet': 'Tariffs on Chinese imports have endangered small business around the United States — a growing nightmare that critics say the president could have avoided.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sam Cobb was surprised to see so many people lined up for a hearing at the International Trade Commission in Washington on the morning of Monday, Aug. 20. The chief executive of Real Wood Floors, Cobb was a veteran of such proceedings, which were usually sleepy affairs, populated by white-shoe attorneys fighting over arcane legal definitions. For this hearing, though, the line stretched out the door and onto the sidewalk along E Street, where the people waiting to get in were surrounded by a scrum of television cameramen. In the preceding weeks, the Trump administration had floated a proposal to place punitive import tariffs on $200 billion of Chinese goods, and the politics of global trade had suddenly burst into the headlines.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '46', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-copy/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-articleLarge.png', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-copy/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-copy/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-copy/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-superJumbo.png', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-copy/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-copy/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-copy/02mag-tariffs-slide-4VI6-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The American Casualties of Trump’s Trade War', 'kicker': 'Feature', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Floored', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the United States Trade Representative', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Missouri', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs (Tariff)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-11-28T10:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Guy Lawson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Guy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lawson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/491b42f6-529f-53bf-b3ef-1025e53babec', 'word_count': 4773, 'uri': 'nyt://article/491b42f6-529f-53bf-b3ef-1025e53babec'}, {'abstract': 'Sometimes it manages conflict and preserves our freedom; sometimes it does precisely the opposite. We may be obligated to sort out which is which.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/28/magazine/when-is-civility-a-duty-and-when-is-it-a-trap.html', 'snippet': 'Sometimes it manages conflict and preserves our freedom; sometimes it does precisely the opposite. We may be obligated to sort out which is which.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lyin’, Liddle, Sloppy, Sneaky, Crazy, Crooked and Pocahontas. It may be immature or uncivil to dole out such pejoratives — poached, apparently, either from the world’s worst “Snow White” knockoff or the name of a Washington law firm — but it always seems to bring the president comfort. As Representative Adam Schiff prepared to take the lead of the House Intelligence Committee, Donald Trump was at the ready with his Rolodex of demeaning monikers, tweeting derisively about “little Adam Schitt.”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-FirstWords-1/02mag-FirstWords-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-FirstWords-1/02mag-FirstWords-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-FirstWords-1/02mag-FirstWords-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-FirstWords-1/02mag-FirstWords-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/02/magazine/02mag-FirstWords-1/02mag-FirstWords-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/12/02/magaz