” sculpture, $3,000, eleanorharwood.com. Kirk Maxson “California Bay Laurel” sculpture (overhead), $4,000. Sam Tho Duong pearl and silver necklace, $24,000. White pumpkin, $16, superiorflorist.com. Rocio acacia wood handbag, $1,125, rocio.co.uk. Chocolate geode by Abby Wilcox, $5,000, (607) 287-7297. Asprey dipping-duck bottle stopper, $1,100. L’Objet Haas Brothers vessel from the Limited-Edition Second Skin Series, $3,500, l-objet.com. Creel and Gow Chilean flamingo, $12,000, creelandgow.com. Jacobsen Salt Co. pink Himalayan salt, $10 for 7.5 ounces, jacobsensalt.com. Jean Roger Paris ceramic algae candlestick, $125, krbnyc.com. Chocolate geode by Abby Wilcox, $8,000. Antique Black Forest German carved wooden deer head, $625, johnderian.com. L’Objet Haas Brothers Lynda plate box, $450.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/t-magazine/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/30/t-magazine/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/t-magazine/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/t-magazine/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY/30tmag-giftguide-slide-OXSY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/t-magazine/30tmag-giftguide-s