d John Ford’s western “The Searchers.” His career is one of triumphs, crackups and sudden reversals, not unlike that of the idealistic rookie cop who is the protagonist of Cox’s first foray into Spanish-language cinema, “Highway Patrolman” (“El Patrullero”).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/arts/30REWIND-1/merlin_147360567_18babbff-d978-4bbb-996b-fd6151c2ce30-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/30/arts/30REWIND-1/merlin_147360567_18babbff-d978-4bbb-996b-fd6151c2ce30-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/arts/30REWIND-1/merlin_147360567_18babbff-d978-4bbb-996b-fd6151c2ce30-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/arts/30REWIND-1/merlin_147360567_18babbff-d978-4bbb-996b-fd6151c2ce30-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1149, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/arts/30REWIND-1/30REWIND-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/11/30/arts/30REWIND-1/30REWIND-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/arts/30REWIND-1/30REWIND-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}