d-555b-5f38-8a29-a8cb820e866a'}, {'abstract': 'Meek Mill, a multiplatinum hip-hop artist and an advocate of criminal justice reform, describes how a disproportionate number of men and women of color are treated unfairly by a broken criminal justice system.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/29/learning/film-club-meek-mill-prisoners-deserve-a-new-set-of-rights.html', 'snippet': 'Meek Mill, a multiplatinum hip-hop artist and an advocate of criminal justice reform, describes how a disproportionate number of men and women of color are treated unfairly by a broken criminal justice system.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Prisoners Deserve a New Set of Rights” is a two-minute film on themes of justice, racism and the need to use one’s voice to make change. In it, Meek Mill, a multiplatinum hip-hop artist and an advocate of criminal justice reform, describes how a disproportionate number of men and women of color are treated unfairly by a broken criminal justice system. In a related written piece, he describes the foundation he is setting up to help.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Film Club: ‘Meek Mill: Prisoners Deserve a New Set of Rights’', 'kicker': 'Film Club', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-11-29T17:02:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Learning', 'section_name': 'The Learning Network', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0205c64f-bb43-5eb3-805d-2e3b5b433e2a', 'word_count': 525, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0205c64f-bb43-5eb3-805d-2e3b5b433e2a'}, {'abstract': 'La Liste, based in Paris, used reviews and comments from critics and diners to choose the Manhattan seafood mainstay and Restaurant Guy Savoy as the world’s best. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/29/dining/la-liste-restaurant-ranking-le-ber