nt climate had left them, and their audience of political moderates, out in the cold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/29/opinion/bipartisan-summit-houston-obama-baker.html', 'snippet': 'Baker is still sharp at 88, and Obama is a mere 57, but you couldn’t help feeling that the current climate had left them, and their audience of political moderates, out in the cold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOUSTON — They sat on the stage in high-backed leather chairs, like kings of a lost world, and maybe they were. On Tuesday night, James Baker celebrated the 25th anniversary of his namesake think tank at Houston’s Rice University by inviting the 44th president of the United States over for a black-tie chat, with the presidential historian of choice Jon Meacham as a respectful if extraneous moderator.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/29/opinion/29Swartz/merlin_147411198_1fb4670a-2bbf-48d4-a8df-3686d930a5f2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/29/opinion/29Swartz/merlin_147411198_1fb4670a-2bbf-48d4-a8df-3686d930a5f2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/29/opinion/29Swartz/merlin_147411198_1fb4670a-2bbf-48d4-a8df-3686d930a5f2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/29/opinion/29Swartz/merlin_147411198_1fb4670a-2bbf-48d4-a8df-3686d930a5f2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1456, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type