ier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00309697-ff0a-5bc2-b4c3-5f280575c43e', 'word_count': 1396, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00309697-ff0a-5bc2-b4c3-5f280575c43e'}, {'abstract': 'The scribblings of a brilliant 20th-century physicist show that he did not get everything right on the first try, either.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/29/science/richard-feynman-auction.html', 'snippet': 'The scribblings of a brilliant 20th-century physicist show that he did not get everything right on the first try, either.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the titans of 20th-century physics, Richard Feynman deciphered the interplay of fundamental particles and forces. He wrote popular books in which he portrayed himself as a charming scientific rogue, and played a key role in the investigation of the loss of the space shuttle Challenger. While brilliant, he was not perfect. That becomes evident looking at some of his papers that go up for auction on Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/science/30feynman-top/merlin_147449115_a9e3bf72-a851-4e7c-a4f7-0095e138a8fb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 435, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/30/science/30feynman-top/merlin_147449115_a9e3bf72-a851-4e7c-a4f7-0095e138a8fb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 435}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/science/30feynman-top/merlin_147449115_a9e3bf72-a851-4e7c-a4f7-0095e138a8fb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 742, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/30/science/30feynman-top/mer