, 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1feec64f-38f1-5875-9919-6e8847b58ff9', 'word_count': 2752, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1feec64f-38f1-5875-9919-6e8847b58ff9'}, {'abstract': 'Democrats backed by Mr. Bloomberg’s organization won 21 of 24 House races, making him among the most influential donors of the election cycle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/30/us/politics/michael-bloomberg-democrats-donate.html', 'snippet': 'Democrats backed by Mr. Bloomberg’s organization won 21 of 24 House races, making him among the most influential donors of the election cycle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A week before the Nov. 6 election, Kendra Horn, a Democratic House candidate in Oklahoma, received unexpected good news from her television consultant: Michael R. Bloomberg’s political action committee, a leading supporter of Democratic candidates, had purchased more than $400,000 in advertising on Oklahoma City television.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/01/us/politics/01bloomberg1/merlin_145250514_b808381d-e2ee-49d1-9a14-6eaf56e86c81-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/12/01/us/politics/01bloomberg1/merlin_145250514_b808381d-e2ee-49d1-9a14-6eaf56e86c81-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/01/us/politics/01bloomberg1/merlin_145250514_b808381d-e2ee-49d1-9a14-6eaf56e86c81-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/12/0