icle/e73c0d3b-3169-57d6-9743-3f1f0a5ab37d'}, {'abstract': 'The first all-important step for caravan migrants who come to northern Mexico to seek asylum in the United States is to get on The List.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/11/30/world/americas/caravan-migrants-tijuana-mexico.html', 'snippet': 'The first all-important step for caravan migrants who come to northern Mexico to seek asylum in the United States is to get on The List.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TIJUANA, Mexico — They call it “La Lista” — The List. And the thousands of migrants who have arrived in northern Mexico in recent weeks with plans to apply for asylum in the United States have quickly learned its importance to their future.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/29/world/caravan-list2/merlin_147492960_e51c7aa2-4b6a-4509-8fed-02da20ed16c9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/11/29/world/caravan-list2/merlin_147492960_e51c7aa2-4b6a-4509-8fed-02da20ed16c9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/29/world/caravan-list2/merlin_147492960_e51c7aa2-4b6a-4509-8fed-02da20ed16c9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/29/world/caravan-list2/merlin_147492960_e51c7aa2-4b6a-4509-8fed-02da20ed16c9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/11/29/world/caravan-list2/caravan-list2-thumbStandard.